hadiths[283]{hadithnumber,text}:
"116","[AI-translation] Talha bin Ubaidullah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur Islam ke bare mein sawal kiya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Din raat mein paanch namazen.' Us ne kaha: Kya in ke siwa mujh par kuch hai? To Aap ne farmaya: 'Nahin, siwae is ke ke tum nafl padho.'"
"117","[AI-translation] Talha bin Ubaidullah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Najd walon mein se ek dehati aaya jis ke baal bikhre hue the, is ki awaz ki bhanbhanahat sunai deti thi aur samajh na aata ke woh kya kah raha hai. Yahan tak ke woh nazdeek aaya, tab maloom hua ke woh Islam ke bare mein sawal kar raha hai. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Din raat mein paanch namazen.' Us ne kaha: Kya is ke ilawa to mujh par koi namaz farz nahin? Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Nahin, magar yeh ke tu nafl padhe.' Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne is ke liye Ramazan ke rozon ka zikr kiya, us ne kaha: Kya is ke ilawa aur to koi roza mujh par farz nahin? Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Nahin, magar yeh ke tu nafli rakhe.' Woh aadmi yeh alfaz kahta hua wapas chala gaya ke Allah ki qasam na main is mein zyadati karunga na kami. Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Agar yeh sachcha hai to kamyab ho gaya.'"
"118","[AI-translation] Naﬁ' bin Jubair se, Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jibra'il Alaihissalam ne Baitullah ke paas do daf'a meri imamat ki. Pahli baar zuhr ki namaz is waqt padhi jabke saya jute ke tasma ke barabar tha. Phir asr ki namaz is waqt padhi jab har cheez ka saya is ke barabar ho gaya aur maghrib is waqt padhi jab rozedar ne roza khola, phir isha ki namaz is waqt padhi jab surkhi ghaib ho gai. Phir subah ki namaz is waqt padhi jab rozedar par khana, peena haram ho gaya. Phir doosri baar zuhr ki namaz is waqt padhi jab har cheez ka saya is ke barabar ho gaya, jis waqt unhon ne kal asr ki namaz padhi thi. Phir asr ki namaz is waqt padhi jab har cheez ka saya do guna ho gaya. Phir maghrib ki namaz isi waqt padhi jis waqt pahli baar padhi thi. Phir isha ki namaz is waqt padhi jab ek tuhai raat guzar gai, phir subah ki namaz is waqt padhi jab zameen khoob roshan ho gai. Phir Jibra'il Alaihissalam meri taraf mutawajjeh hue aur farmaya: Aey Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam)! Aap se pahle paighambaron ka yahi waqt tha aur namaz ka waqt in donon waqton ke darmiyan hai."
"119","[AI-translation] Zuhri se riwayat hai ke Umar bin Abdul Aziz ne namaz mein takheer ki to Urwah ne unhen kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jibra'il aae, meri imamat ki aur main ne in ke sath namaz padhi, phir Jibra'il aae, meri imamat ki aur main ne in ke sath namaz padhi, phir Jibra'il aae, meri imamat ki aur main ne in ke sath namaz padhi, phir Jibra'il aae, meri imamat ki aur main ne in ke sath namaz padhi, phir Jibra'il aae, meri imamat ki aur main ne in ke sath namaz padhi, yahan tak ke paanch namazon ko shumar kiya.' To Umar bin Abdul Aziz ne farmaya: Urwah Allah se daro! Kya kah rahe ho. Urwah ne Umar bin Abdul Aziz se kaha mujhe Basheer bin Abi Mas'ud ne apne baap se khabar di hai woh apne baap se bayan karte hain aur unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat ki hai."
"120","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai woh bayan farmati hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) subah ki namaz padhte aur aurten apni chadron mein lipti hui wapas hotin to woh andhere ki wajah se pahchani na jati thin."
"121","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai woh bayan farmati hain momina aurten Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath namaz padhtin aur woh chadron mein lipti hotin, phir apne gharon ko lautatin to andhere ki wajah se pahchani na jati thin."
"122","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai woh bayan farmati hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) subah ki namaz padhte, to aurten chadron mein lipti hui wapas aatin, aur andhere ki wajah se pahchani na jati thin."
"123","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se ek doosri sanad se bhi isi tarah ki hadees marvi hai."
"124","[AI-translation] Hibban bin Haris kahte hain main Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas aaya jabke woh Abu Musa mein in ke ghar lashkar ke sath the. Main ne dekha woh khana kha rahe the. Unhon ne kaha: 'Aao khana khao.' Main ne kaha, roze ka irada hai to unhon ne kaha mera bhi yahi irada tha, phir main ne bhi khana khaya, jab khane se farigh hue to farmaya: 'Aey Tayyah ke bete! Aao namaz padhen.'"
"125","[AI-translation] Abu Barzah Aslami (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki namaz ka tareeqa bayan karte hue farmate hain ke Aap subah ki namaz se farigh ho kar wapas mudte to ham mein se koi apne sath baithe hue ko andhere ki wajah se nahin pahchan sakta tha, aur Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) saath se sau aayat tak ki tilawat farmate the."
"126","[AI-translation] Ziyad bin Ilaqah apne chacha se bayan karte hain, woh kahte hain main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko subah ki namaz mein «wal-nakhla basiqat» padhte suna. Imam Shafi'i farmate hain: Yani Surah Qaf padha karte the."
"127","[AI-translation] Amr bin Hurais (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai bayan farmate hain main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko suna ke Aap subah ki namaz mein «wal-laili iza 'as'as» padhte the. Imam Shafi'i farmate hain yani Aap subah ki namaz mein «iza-shamsu kuwwirat» ki tilawat karte."
"128","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Sa'ib (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, bayan farmate hain, hamen Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Makkah mein subah ki namaz padhai, Aap ne Surah Mominun shuru ki, hatta ke jab Musa aur Harun Alaihimasalam ka zikr aaya ya Eisa Alaihissalam ka zikr aaya, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko khansi aa gai, to Aap ne qiraat chhod kar ruku' kiya. Rawi kahte hain Abdullah bin Sa'ib (Raziyallahu anhu) is namaz mein maujood the."
"129","[AI-translation] Urwah se riwayat karte hain ke Abu Bakr Siddiq (Raziyallahu anhu) ne subah ki namaz ki donon rak'aton mein Surah Baqarah mukammal padhi."
"130","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Aamir kahte hain ham ne Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ke peeche subah ki namaz padhi, unhon ne pahli rak'at mein Surah Yusuf aur doosri mein Surah Hajj padhi aur aahista aahista qiraat ki, rawi kahte hain main ne kaha: 'Allah ki qasam tab to woh namaz tulu fajr ke sath khadi karte honge', to Abdullah bin Aamir (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha, 'Han'."
"131","[AI-translation] FARafisah bin Umair Hanafi farmate hain main ne Surah Yusuf ka padhna Usman bin Affan (Raziyallahu anhu) se liya hai kyunke Aap kasrat se is ko subah ki namaz mein padhte."
"132","[AI-translation] Rafi' bin Khadij (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Subah ki namaz roshni mein padho is se tum ko zyada ajr milta hai' ya farmaya: 'Zyada sawab hai.'"
"133","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai woh bayan karte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab garmi taiz ho jae to namaz ko thande waqt mein padho, kyunke garmi ki taizi dozakh ki aag ki bhaap ki wajah se hai.' Aur farmaya: 'Dozakh ne apne Rab se shikayat ki aur kaha: Aey mere Rab! Mere baaz hisse ne baaz ko kha liya hai. Is par Allah Ta'ala ne use do saans lene ki ijazat de di, ek saans sardi mein aur ek saans garmi mein, ab intehai sakht garmi aur sakht sardi jo tum mahsoos karte ho woh isi se paida hoti hai."
"134","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai woh bayan karte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab garmi taiz ho jae to namaz ko thande waqt mein padho, kyunke garmi ki taizi dozakh ki aag ki bhaap ki wajah se hai.'"
"135","[AI-translation] Ek doosri sanad se Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se isi sabiqa hadees ki misl marvi hai."
"136","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab garmi taiz ho jae to namaz ko thande waqt mein padha karo kyunke garmi ki taizi dozakh ki aag ki bhaap ki wajah se hai.'"
"137","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai woh bayan farmate hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) asr ki namaz padhte aur suraj safed chamak raha hota, phir koi jane wala Awali ki taraf jata woh wahan pahunch jata aur suraj abhi tak buland hota."
"138","[AI-translation] Naufal bin Mu'awiyah Dailami (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai bayan farmate hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jis shakhs ki asr ki namaz faut ho gai goya ke is ka maal aur is ka ahal halak ho gaya.'"
"139","[AI-translation] Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai woh bayan farmate hain ke ham Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath maghrib ki namaz padhte, phir teer andazi ke liye nikalte yahan tak ke Banu Salamah ke gharon mein dakhil ho jate aur ham roshni ki wajah se teer ke girne ki jagah ko dekh lete the."
"140","[AI-translation] Zaid bin Khalid Juhani (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath maghrib ki namaz padhte, phir bazar ki taraf jate, agar teer phenka jata to is ke girne ki jagah maloom ho jati."
"141","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath namaz padhte, phir Banu Salamah ki taraf jate aur teer ke girne ki jagah dekhte."
"142","[AI-translation] Ibn Jubair bin Mut'im se, apne walid se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko maghrib mein Surah Toor padhte suna."
"143","[AI-translation] Ubaidullah bin Abdullah se, Ibn Abbas se, Ummul Fazl bint Haris se riwayat hai ke unhon ne inhen «wal-mursalati 'urfa» padhte suna. Unhon ne kaha: Aey mere bete! Tune mujhe apni is surah ki qiraat se yaad dila diya, beshak yeh aakhri hai jo main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko maghrib mein padhte suna."
"144","[AI-translation] Ubadah bin Nusaiy se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Qais bin Haris ko kahte suna: Abu Abdullah Sunabihi ne mujhe khabar di ke woh Hazrat Abu Bakr Siddiq (Raziyallahu anhu) ki khilafat mein Madinah aae aur unhon ne Hazrat Abu Bakr Siddiq (Raziyallahu anhu) ke peeche maghrib ki namaz padhi. To unhon ne pahli do rak'aton mein Ummul Quran aur qisar mufassal mein se ek surah padhi, phir teesri rak'at mein khade hue. To main in ke qareeb hua yahan tak ke mere kapde taqreeban in ke kapdon ko chhoone lage, phir main ne inhen Ummul Quran aur yeh aayat padhte suna: Aey hamare Rab! Hamare dilon ko tedha na kar is ke baad ke Tune hamen hidayat di, aur hamen apne paas se rahmat ata kar, beshak Tu bahut dene wala hai [Aal Imran: 8]."
"145","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mu'az bin Jabal Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath isha ki namaz padhte, phir wapas ja kar Banu Salamah mein apni qaum ki imamat karte. Unhon ne kaha: Phir Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek raat isha moakhar ki. Unhon ne kaha: To Mu'az ne Aap ke sath namaz padhi, phir wapas ja kar qaum ki imamat ki. To unhon ne Surah Baqarah se aaghaz kiya. To in ke peeche se ek aadmi alag ho gaya aur akele namaz padhi. To unhon ne use kaha: Kya tu munafiq ho gaya? Us ne kaha: Nahin, lekin main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aata hun. Phir woh Aap ke paas aaya aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Aap ne isha moakhar ki, aur Mu'az ne Aap ke sath namaz padhi, phir wapas ja kar hamari imamat ki, to Surah Baqarah se aaghaz kiya. Jab main ne yeh dekha to peeche hat gaya aur namaz padhi. Ham to khet wale log hain apne hathon se kaam karte hain. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Mu'az ki taraf mutawajjeh hue aur farmaya: 'Kya tum fitna dalne wale ho aey Mu'az? Kya tum fitna dalne wale ho? Falan surah aur falan surah padho.'"
"146","[AI-translation] Jabir se isi ki misl riwayat hai, aur us mein izafa kiya ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: 'Sabbihisma Rabbikal A'la, Wal Laili Iza Yaghsha, Was Sama'i Wat Tariq aur is jaise padho.' Sufyan ne kaha: To main ne Amr se kaha: Beshak Abu Zubair kahte hain: Un se farmaya: Sabbihisma Rabbikal A'la, Wal Laili Iza Yaghsha, Was Sama'i Wat Tariq padho. Amr ne kaha: Woh yahi ya is jaise hain."
"147","[AI-translation] Nafi' Maula Ibn Umar se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Umar safar mein padhte. Unhon ne kaha: Mera khayal hai unhon ne Atamah mein kaha: Iza Zulzilatil Arz, to Ummul Quran padhi, jab us se farigh hue to kaha: Bismillahir Rahmanir Rahim, Bismillahir Rahmanir Rahim, Bismillahir Rahmanir Rahim. Unhon ne kaha: To main ne kaha: Iza Zulzilat. To unhon ne kaha: Iza Zulzilat."
"148","[AI-translation] Ibn Abi Lubaid se, Abu Salamah bin Abdur Rahman se, Ibn Umar se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Dehati tum par tumhari namaz ke naam mein ghalib na aaen, woh Isha hai, siwae is ke ke woh oonton ko raat mein dohte hain.'"
"149","[AI-translation] Malik se, Zaid bin Aslam se, Ata bin Yasar se, Busr bin Sa'id se aur A'raj se jo unhen Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se bayan karte hain se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jis ne subah ki ek rak'at suraj tulu hone se pahle pa li to us ne subah pa li, aur jis ne asr ki ek rak'at suraj ghurub hone se pahle pa li to us ne asr pa li.'"
"150","[AI-translation] Abu Salamah se, Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jis ne namaz ki ek rak'at pa li to us ne namaz pa li.'"
"151","[AI-translation] Ibn Musayyab se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) subah ki namaz se so gae phir use suraj tulu hone ke baad padha. Aur Aap ne farmaya: 'Jo namaz bhool jae to use jab yaad aae padh le, kyunke Allah Azza wa Jalla farmate hain: Aur meri yaad ke liye namaz qaim karo [Taha: 14].'"
"152","[AI-translation] Nafi' bin Jubair se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke Sahaba mein se ek aadmi se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) safar mein the, phir raat ko thehre. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Kya koi naik aadmi nahin jo aaj raat hamari hifazat kare? Ham namaz se so na jaen.' To Bilal (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Main, Ya Rasulullah. Unhon ne kaha: To Bilal apni sawari se tek laga kar fajr ki taraf munh karke baithe, phir woh suraj ki garmi ke chehron par padne hi se jaage. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Aey Bilal.' To Bilal ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Mujhe us ne pakad liya jis ne Aap ko pakda. Unhon ne kaha: To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne wuzu kiya phir fajr ki do rak'aten padhin, phir unhon ne thoda safar kiya. Unhon ne kaha: Phir Aap ne fajr padhi."
"153","[AI-translation] Abdur Rahman bin Abi Sa'id Khudri se, Abu Sa'id se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham Khandaq ke din namaz se roke gae yahan tak ke maghrib ke baad raat ka kuch hissa guzar gaya jab tak ham us se kifayat pa gae. Aur woh Allah Azza wa Jalla ka qaul hai: Aur Allah ne mominon ko ladai se kifayat kar diya aur Allah taqatwar zabardast hai [Ahzab: 25]. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Bilal ko bulaya aur unhen hukm diya. To unhon ne zuhr ki iqamat kahi aur use padha aur is ki namaz ko achchi tarah padha jaise woh use is ke waqt mein padhte the, phir asr ki iqamat kahi aur use isi tarah padha, phir maghrib ki iqamat kahi aur use isi tarah padha phir isha ki iqamat kahi aur use bhi isi tarah padha. Unhon ne kaha: Aur woh salat khauf ke bare mein nazil hone se pahle tha: To paidal ya sawar ho kar [Baqarah: 239]."
"154","[AI-translation] A'raj se, Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne asr ke baad suraj ghurub hone tak namaz se mana farmaya, aur subah ke baad suraj tulu hone tak namaz se mana farmaya."
"155","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Tum mein se koi suraj tulu hone ya ghurub hone ke waqt namaz ka qasd na kare.'"
"156","[AI-translation] Abdullah Sunabihi se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Beshak suraj tulu hota hai aur is ke sath shaitan ka seeng hota hai. Phir jab woh buland ho jata hai to woh is se alag ho jata hai. Phir jab woh darmiyan mein aa jata hai to woh is ke sath ho jata hai. Phir jab woh dhal jata hai to woh is se alag ho jata hai. Phir jab woh ghurub hone ke qareeb hota hai to woh is ke sath ho jata hai. Phir jab woh ghurub ho jata hai to woh is se alag ho jata hai.' Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne in auqat mein namaz se mana farmaya."
"157","[AI-translation] Sa'id Maqburi se, Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne dopahar ko suraj dhalne tak namaz se mana farmaya, siwae juma ke din."
"158","[AI-translation] Thawus se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Ibn Abbas se asr ke baad ki do rak'aton ke bare mein poocha to unhon ne unhen in se mana kiya. Thawus ne kaha: To main ne kaha: Main inhen nahin chhodunga! To Ibn Abbas ne farmaya: Aur kisi momin mard aur momin aurat ke liye jaiz nahin jab Allah aur Us ke Rasool kisi baat ka faisla kar den [Ahzab: 36]."
"159","[AI-translation] Abu Salamah bin Abdur Rahman se riwayat hai ke Mu'awiyah bin Abi Sufyan (Raziyallahu anhu) Madinah tashreef lae. Woh mimbar par tashreef farma the ke Kaseer bin Salt se farmaya: 'Jao Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ke paas aur in se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki asr ke baad wali namaz se mutalliq pooch kar aao!' Abu Salamah kahte hain: Main bhi in ke hamrah Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ke paas gaya, jabke Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne bhi hamare sath Abdullah bin Haris bin Naufal ko bheja, woh Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ke paas aae aur in se is ke mutalliq poocha, to Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ne Kaseer bin Salt se kaha: 'Umm Salamah (Raziyallahu anha) ke paas jao aur in se poocho.' Abu Salamah kahte hain: Main bhi in ke sath Umm Salamah (Raziyallahu anha) ke paas gaya aur in se is ke mutalliq sawal kiya, to Umm Salamah (Raziyallahu anha) ne farmaya: 'Ek din asr ke baad Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) mere han tashreef lae to do rak'aten padhin jinhen main ne Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko pahle kabhi padhte nahin dekha tha, phir farmaya: Main zuhr ke baad do rak'aten padhta hun, hua yun ke mere paas Banu Tamim ka wafd aaya ya sadqa ka maal aaya, main woh rak'aten na padh saka, to yeh woh zuhr ke baad wali do rak'aten hain.'"
"160","[AI-translation] Abu Salamah farmate hain Mu'awiyah (Raziyallahu anhu) Madinah tashreef lae, woh mimbar par baithe the jab unhon ne kaha: 'Aey Kaseer bin Salt! Mominon ki maa Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ke paas jao aur in se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki asr ke baad wali do rak'aton ke bare mein poocho!' Abu Salamah kahte hain main bhi Kaseer bin Salt ke hamrah gaya aur Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne hamare sath Abdullah bin Haris ko bheja aur in se kaha: 'Jao aur suno! Mominon ki maa kya farmati hain.' Unhon ne aa kar Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se sawal kiya to Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ne farmaya: 'Mujhe is se mutalliq ilm nahin hai, Aap Umm Salamah (Raziyallahu anha) ke paas ja kar in se yeh mas'ala poocho.' Abu Salamah farmate hain: Main bhi in ke sath Umm Salamah (Raziyallahu anha) ke paas gaya, to unhon ne farmaya: 'Ek din Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) asr ke baad mere ghar tashreef lae to Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne do rak'aten padhin jo main ne Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko pahle padhte hue nahin dekha tha, main ne poocha: Aey Allah ke Rasool (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam)! Aap ne aaj aisi namaz padhi hai jo is se qabl main ne Aap ko padhte nahin dekha? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main zuhr ke baad do rak'aten padhta hun, mere paas Banu Tamim ka wafd aaya ya Banu Tamim ka sadqa, to unhon ne mujhe in rak'at se masroof kar diya, to yeh woh zuhr ke baad wali do rak'aten hain.'"
"161","[AI-translation] Qais (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai woh bayan farmate hain, mujhe Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne subah ki namaz ke baad do rak'aten padhte hue dekha to farmaya: 'Aey Qais yeh do rak'aten kaisi hain?' Qais farmate hain main ne kaha main ne fajr ki do sunnaten nahin padhi thin, yeh sun kar Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) khamosh ho gae."
"162","[AI-translation] Jubair bin Mut'im (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Aey Bani Abd Manaf! Jo koi tum mein se logon par hukmaran bane, to woh kisi ko bhi raat ya din mein jis waqt is ghar ka tawaf karna aur namaz padhna chahe mana na kare.'"
"163","[AI-translation] Ata ne ek doosri sanad se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se sabiqa hadees ke misl hi bayan kiya hai albatta is Ata ki sanad mein yeh zyadati hai: 'Aey Bani Abdul Muttalib ya aey Bani Hashim ya aey Bani Abd Manaf.'"
"164","[AI-translation] Amr bin Dinar se riwayat hai woh farmate hain: 'Main ne Aban aur Ata bin Abi Rabah ko dekha, beshak Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne namaz subah ke baad Baitullah ka tawaf kiya aur suraj tulu hone se qabl namaz padhi.'"
"165","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Muhairiz se riwayat hai jo Abu Mahzurah (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas bachpan mein yateem hone ki wajah se zair parwarish rahe the. Jab Abu Mahzurah ne unhen Sham bheja to Abdullah bin Muhairiz farmate hain: Main ne Abu Mahzurah (Raziyallahu anhu) se kaha: 'Aey chacha! Main Sham ki taraf ja raha hun, aur mujhe khadsha hai ke mujh se Aap ki azan ke mutalliq poocha jaega lehaza mujhe mas'ala samjha dijiye' To Abu Mahzurah (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: 'Han, main chand afrad ke sath safar par rawana hua ham Hunain ke raste par the, Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ghazwa Hunain se laute aur ham ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se raste mein mulaqat ki. Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke padao mein Aap ke muazzin ne namaz ke liye azan kahi, aur ham Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bar-gashta the, ham muazzin ka mazaq udate hue buland awaz se is ki naqal utarne lage, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamari awaz suni to hamari taraf aadmi bheje to unhon ne hamen Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke samne la khada kiya. Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se kis ki buland awaz mujhe sunai di thi? Sari qaum ne meri taraf ishara kiya aur in ki baat durust thi. Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujhe rok kar baqi sab ko bhej diya, aur farmaya: Khade ho kar namaz ke liye azan kaho! Main khada ho gaya lekin meri kaifiyat yeh thi ke mujhe Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki zaat aur Aap ke hukm se intehai nafrat mahsoos ho rahi thi. Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke samne khada ho gaya to Aap ne khud mujhe azan sikhai, farmaya: Kaho: Allahu Akbar Allahu Akbar, Allahu Akbar Allahu Akbar, Ashhadu alla ilaha illallah, Ashhadu alla ilaha illallah, Ashhadu anna Muhammadan Rasulullah, Ashhadu anna Muhammadan Rasulullah, phir farmaya: Lauto aur apni awaz buland karo. Phir farmaya: Kaho: Ashhadu alla ilaha illallah, Ashhadu alla ilaha illallah, Ashhadu anna Muhammadan Rasulullah, Ashhadu anna Muhammadan Rasulullah, Hayya alas salah, Hayya alas salah, Hayya alal falah, Hayya alal falah, Allahu Akbar Allahu Akbar, La ilaha illallah. Phir unhon ne mujhe pukara jab main azan se farigh hua. To unhon ne mujhe chandi ki thaili di. Phir unhon ne Abu Mahzurah ki peshani par apna hath rakha phir use chehre phir donon seenon ke darmiyan phir jigar tak phaira yahan tak ke un ka hath Abu Mahzurah ki naaf tak pahuncha. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah tumhen barkat de aur tum par barkat kare. To main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Mujhe Makkah ki azan ka hukm den. To Aap ne farmaya: Main ne tumhen is ka hukm de diya hai. Aur Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se narazgi mujh se khatm ho gai aur aisi muhabbat mein badal gai. Phir main Attab bin Asid Aamil Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke hukm se namaz ki azan kahi. Ibn Juraij ne kaha: Mujhe is ke bare mein Aal Abu Mahzurah mein se jinhen main ne paya unhon ne Ibn Muhairiz ki khabar ki manind khabar di. Shafi'i ne farmaya: Aur main ne Ibrahim bin Abdul Aziz bin Abdul Malik bin Abi Mahzurah ko paya ke woh azan kahte the jaise Ibn Muhairiz ne bayan kiya. Aur main ne inhen apne walid se, Ibn Abi Muhairiz se, Abu Mahzurah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se Ibn Juraij ki bayan karda baat ke ma'na bayan karte suna."
"166","[AI-translation] Imam Mujahid Allah Ta'ala ke farman 'Aur ham ne Aap ka zikr buland kiya [Alam Nashrah: 4]' ke mutalliq farmate hain: 'Mere sath Aap ka bhi zikr kiya jaega.' Main gawahi deta hun ke Allah ke ilawa koi ma'bud nahin aur main gawahi deta hun ke Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Allah ke Rasool hain."
"167","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Abi Sa'sa'ah se riwayat hai ke mujhe Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: 'Main dekhta hun ke tu bakriyon aur jangal ko pasand karta hai, jab tum apni bakriyon ya jangal mein ho, aur namaz ke liye azan kahe to apni awaz buland karo, kyunke jo bhi jinn insan ya koi cheez teri awaz sune gi woh tere liye qayamat ke din gawahi de gi.' Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: 'Main ne yeh baat Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se suni hai.'"
"168","[AI-translation] Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab tum azan suno to isi tarah kaho jis tarah azan dene wala kahta hai.'"
"169","[AI-translation] Mu'awiyah (Raziyallahu anhu) bayan farmate hain, main ne suna Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) farma rahe the: 'Jab muazzin ne kaha to Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne bhi kaha, aur jab us ne kaha to Aap ne farmaya: Main bhi gawahi deta hun', phir Aap khamosh ho gae."
"170","[AI-translation] Ek doosri sanad se Mu'awiyah (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se yahi hadees bayan farmate hain."
"171","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Alqamah bin Waqqas farmate hain jab Mu'awiyah (Raziyallahu anhu) ke muazzin ne azan di to main in ke paas maujood tha to Mu'awiyah (Raziyallahu anhu) ne is tarah kaha jis tarah in ke muazzin ne kaha, yahan tak ke jab us ne kaha to Aap ne farmaya, aur jab us ne kaha to Aap ne padha, phir is ke baad wahi alfaz dohrae jo muazzin ne kahe phir farmaya: 'Main ne suna Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) isi tarah kiya karte the.'"
"172","[AI-translation] Hafs bin Aasim farmate hain ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek aadmi ko maghrib ki azan dete hue suna to Aap ne is ki azan ka jawab diya, Hafs kahte hain ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) is aadmi ki taraf gae jis ne kaha to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Aao is kale ghulam ki iqamat se maghrib ki namaz ada karo.'"
"173","[AI-translation] Hasan se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Azan dene wale logon ki in ki namazon par amanatdar hain.'"
"174","[AI-translation] Yahya Mazini se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Hamam aur qabristan ke ilawa tamam zameen masjid hai.' Imam Shafi'i farmate hain main ne is hadees ko apni kitab mein do jagah paya hai, ek jagah par munqata' aur doosri jagah par Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) se marvi hai. Woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bayan farmate hain."
"175","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Ma'qil ya Mughaffal se marvi hai woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab tumhen bakriyon ke baade mein namaz ka waqt ho jae to is mein namaz padh lo, kyunke yeh rahmat aur barkat hai, aur jab tumhen oonton ke baade mein namaz ka waqt ho jae to is se niklo aur bahar aa kar namaz padho! Kyunke yeh woh jinon se paida kiya gaya hai. Kya tum dekhte nahin ke jab woh ghussa mein ho to naak se kis tarah buland aawaz nikalta hai.'"
"176","[AI-translation] Usman bin Abi Sulaiman se riwayat hai ke jab qaidiyon ka fidya dene ke liye Quraish ke mushrik Madinah aae to woh masjid mein raat guzarte the, in mein Jubair bin Mut'im bhi the, Jubair (Raziyallahu anhu) farmate hain main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki qiraat suna karta tha."
"177","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai woh bayan farmate hain: 'Quba mein log subah ki namaz padh rahe the ke ek shakhs ne aa kar kaha ke raat ko Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) par Quran utara gaya hai jis mein Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko Ka'ba rukh ho kar namaz ada karne ka hukm diya gaya hai to logon ne is ki taraf munh kar liya. In ke chehre Sham ki janib the woh namaz mein Ka'ba ki janib mud gae.'"
"178","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai woh bayan farmate hain: 'Log Quba mein fajr ki namaz padh rahe the ke ek shakhs ne aa kar bataya ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) par raat Quran nazil kiya gaya jis mein unhen Ka'ba ki taraf munh karne ka hukm ho gaya hai. Chunacha in logon ne bhi Ka'ba ki taraf munh kar liye jabke is waqt in ke chehre Sham ki janib the woh sab Ka'ba ki janib ghoom gae.'"
"179","[AI-translation] Sa'id bin Musayyab farmate hain: 'Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne solah mah tak Baitul Maqdis ki janib munh kar ke namazen padhin, phir ghazwa Badr se do mah qabl qibla tabdeel kar diya gaya.'"
"180","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Ka'ba mein dakhil hue aur Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Bilal, Usamah aur Usman bin Talhah (Raziyallahu anhum) the, Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) kahte hain, main ne Bilal (Raziyallahu anhu) se poocha, Ka'ba ke andar Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne kya kiya? Bilal (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: 'Ek sutoon Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke baen janib aur ek daen janib, jabke teen sutoon Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke peeche the aur Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne namaz padhi.' Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: 'Is waqt Baitullah ki chhat chhe sutoonon par thi.'"
"181","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai woh bayan farmate hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Ka'ba mein dakhil hue. Bilal Usman bin Talhah aur rawi kahte hain mera khayal hai farmaya Usamah (Raziyallahu anhum) bhi Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath the. Jab Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) bahar tashreef lae to main ne Bilal (Raziyallahu anhu) se poocha Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Baitullah mein kya kiya? To unhon ne kaha, 'Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek sutoon apne daen janib rakha, do sutoon baen janib aur teen sutoon Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke peeche the, phir Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne namaz padhi, aur is waqt Baitullah ki chhat chhe sutoonon par thi.'"
"182","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai bayan farmati hain ke: 'Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) raat ko namaz padhte aur main Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke aur qibla ke darmiyan is tarah laiti hoti jis tarah janaza mein maiyat hoti hai.'"
"183","[AI-translation] Abu Juhaifah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai woh bayan farmate hain ke: 'Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko Abtah maqam par namaz padhte hue dekha, Bilal (Raziyallahu anhu) naiza le kar aae aur is ko gaad diya, to Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne is ko sutra bana kar namaz padhi. Jabke kutta, aurat aur gadha Aap ke aage se guzarte.'"
"184","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai bayan farmate hain: 'Main gadhi par sawar ho kar aaya, aur main in dinon bulooghat ke qareeb tha, aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) logon ko namaz padha rahe the, main saf ke aage se guzra aur utar kar gadhi ko charne ke liye chhod diya, aur namaziyon ki saf mein dakhil ho gaya, is baat par kisi ne mujh par etiraz na kiya.'"
"185","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Tum mein se koi ek kapde mein namaz is tarah na padhe ke is ke kandhon par kuch na ho.'"
"186","[AI-translation] Salamah bin Akwa' (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai farmate hain: 'Main ne kaha aey Allah ke Rasool (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ham shikar mein hote hain, kya ham ek qamees mein namaz padh len? Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Han, aur is ko silai kar lo, agar yeh nahin karsakta to kaante se is ko mila lo.'"
"187","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Tum mein se koi ek kapde mein aise namaz na padhe ke is ke kandhe par kuch na ho.'"
"188","[AI-translation] Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki zauja muhtarma Maimunah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai woh bayan farmati hain: 'Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ek kapde mein namaz padhte jis ka kuch hissa mujh par aur kuch Aap par hota jabke main haalat haiz mein hoti.'"
"189","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai farmate hain: 'Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Banu Amr bin Auf ki masjid mein tashreef lae, Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) namaz padh rahe the ke Ansar ke log aae aur woh Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko namaz ki haalat mein salam karte. Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) kahte hain main ne Suhaib (Raziyallahu anhu) se poocha, Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) unhen kaise jawab dete the? To unhon ne farmaya: Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) in ki taraf ishara karte the.'"
"190","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Mas'ud (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai farmate hain: 'Ham hijrat Habsha se pahle Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko salam kahte jabke Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) namaz mein hote to Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) namaz mein hamen jawab dete, jab ham Habsha se wapas aae to main Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya take Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko salam karun, main ne Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko namaz mein paya, main ne Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko salam kiya lekin Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujhe jawab na diya, to mujh ko nazdeek aur door guzri hui fikren aalagen, main baith gaya yahan tak ke jab Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne namaz mukammal ki to main Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya. Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah Azza wa Jal ke liye tareef hai, woh apne awamir mein jo chahta hai naya hukm de deta hai, aur jo Allah ne naya hukm diya woh yeh ke tum namaz mein baat cheet na karo.'"
"191","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Ali bin Hanafiyah apne baap se riwayat karte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Namaz ki kunji wuzu hai aur is ki tahreem takbeer hai aur tahleel salam hai.'"
"192","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai woh bayan farmate hain: 'Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko dekha jab Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) namaz shuru karte to apne donon hathon ko uthate yahan tak ke in ko kandhon ke barabar karte, aur jab ruku' ka irada karte aur jab ruku' se sar uthate to bhi hathon ko uthate the aur hathon ko sajdon ke darmiyan nahin uthate the.'"
"193","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab namaz shuru karte to apne hathon ko kandhon tak uthate, aur jab ruku' se sar uthate to phir isi tarah hathon ko uthate. Albatta sajdon mein Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) rafa' yadain nahin karte the."
"194","[AI-translation] Nafi', Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat karte hain ke woh jab namaz shuru karte to apne hathon ko kandhon tak uthate, aur jab ruku' se sar uthate to donon hathon ko is se thoda kam uthate."
"195","[AI-translation] Aur isi sabiqa sanad se hai ke Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) jab namaz shuru karte to apne hathon ko kandhon tak uthate aur jab ruku' se uthte to bhi isi tarah hathon ko kandhon tak uthate."
"196","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai woh bayan farmate hain: 'Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko dekha, jab Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) namaz shuru karte to apne hath uthate hatta ke unhen kandhe ke barabar kar lete aur jab ruku' karne lagte aur ruku' se sar uthate to isi tarah rafa' yadain karte aur do sajdon ke darmiyan hath nahin uthate the.'"
"197","[AI-translation] Wail bin Hujr se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko dekha jab Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) namaz shuru karte to apne hathon ko kandhon tak uthate, aur jab ruku' se sar uthate to donon hathon ko is se thoda kam uthate."
"198","[AI-translation] Abdur Rahman bin Abi Laila se, Bara bin Aazib se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko dekha jab Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) namaz shuru karte to apne hath uthate. Sufyan ne kaha: Phir main Kufa aaya aur Yazeed se mila, to use isi tarah bayan karte suna aur is mein izafa kiya, phir dobara na uthae. To mera khayal hua ke unhon ne use sikhaya. Sufyan ne kaha: Isi tarah main ne Yazeed ko use bayan karte suna, phir main ne use isi tarah bayan karte suna aur is mein izafa karta, phir dobara na uthae. Unhon ne kaha: Shafi'i ne farmaya: Aur Sufyan ka khayal tha ke Yazeed is hadees mein ghalti karta hai aur kahta hai: Goya yeh aakhri harf use sikhaya gaya to use sikhaya gaya aur Sufyan Yazeed ko is tarah hifz mein qawi nahin samajhta tha."
"199","[AI-translation] Ali bin Husain se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) har utarne aur chadhne par takbeer kahte. To wahi Aap ki namaz rahi yahan tak ke Allah Azza wa Jalla se ja mile."
"200","[AI-translation] Abu Salamah se riwayat hai ke Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) inhen namaz padhate aur har utarne aur chadhne par takbeer kahte. Jab farigh hue to farmaya: Allah ki qasam! Main tum sab mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki namaz se zyada musabihat rakhne wala hun."
"201","[AI-translation] Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab namaz shuru karte to padhte: Main ne apne chehre ko is zaat ke liye muti' kiya, jis ne aasmanon aur zameen ko paida kiya aur main mushrikon mein se nahin hun. Beshak meri namaz, meri qurbani, meri zindagi aur meri maut Allah Rabbul Aalameen ke liye hai. Is ka koi shareek nahin aur mujhe is baat ka hukm diya gaya hai. Aur main farmanbardaron mein se hun. Aey Allah! Tu hi badshah hai, tere ilawa koi ma'bud nahin, tu paak hai apni tareef ke sath, tu mera Rab hai aur main tera banda hun, main ne apne aap par zulm kiya aur main apne gunahon ka iqrar karta hun, mere sab gunahon ko bakhsh de kyunke tere ilawa koi bhi gunahon ko muaf karne wala nahin hai. Achche akhlaq ki taraf meri rahnumai kar, tere ilawa koi achche akhlaq ki taraf rahnumai karne wala nahin, aur bure akhlaq mujh se door kar de, tere ilawa ise koi door karne wala nahin, aey Allah main hazir hun, aur tamam bhalaiyan tere hath mein hain aur burai ki nisbat teri taraf nahin hai. Aur hidayat wala hi hidayat yafta hai. Main tere sath hun aur teri taraf ruju' karta hun. Tere siwa koi panah nahin. Tu paak hai aur Tu buland hai. Main Tujh se maghfirat mangta hun aur Teri taraf tauba karta hun."
"202","[AI-translation] Abdur Rahman A'raj se, Ubaidullah bin Abi Rafi' se, Ali bin Abi Talib (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya, un mein se ek ne kaha: Jab namaz shuru karte, doosre ne kaha: Jab namaz kholte, farmaya: 'Main ne apne chehre ko is zaat ke liye muti' kiya jis ne aasmanon aur zameen ko paida kiya aur main mushrikon mein se nahin hun. Beshak meri namaz, meri qurbani, meri zindagi aur meri maut Allah Rabbul Aalameen ke liye hai. Is ka koi shareek nahin aur mujhe is baat ka hukm diya gaya hai.' Un mein se ek ne kaha: Aur main pahle Musalmanon mein se hun, doosre ne kaha: Aur main Musalmanon mein se hun. Shafi'i ne farmaya: Phir woh Quran ta'awwuz ke sath padhe phir Bismillahir Rahmanir Rahim, phir jab us par pahunche to Aameen kahe. Aur jo in ke peeche ho woh kahe, agar woh imam ho to apni awaz buland kare yahan tak ke jo peeche ho woh sune jab woh qiraat buland karne walon mein se ho."
"203","[AI-translation] Salih bin Abi Salih se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) ko suna jab woh logon ki imamat karte buland awaz se: Aey hamare Rab! Ham Tujh se mardood shaitan se panah mangte hain, farz namaz mein aur jab Ummul Quran se farigh hote."
"204","[AI-translation] Salih Maula Tau'amah se riwayat hai ke Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) namaz ka aaghaz Bismillahir Rahmanir Rahim [Fatiha: 1] se karte."
"205","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Usman bin Khusaim se riwayat hai ke Abu Bakr bin Hafs bin Umar ne unhen khabar di ke Anas bin Malik ne kaha: Mu'awiyah ne Madinah mein ek namaz padhai jis mein unhon ne Ummul Quran ke liye Bismillahir Rahmanir Rahim [Fatiha: 1] buland awaz se padhi, aur is ke baad wali surah ke liye use na padha yahan tak ke woh qiraat mukammal ki, aur jab jhukte to takbeer na kahi yahan tak ke woh namaz mukammal ki. Jab unhon ne salam phaira to Muhajireen mein se jis ne yeh suna har taraf se unhen pukara: Aey Mu'awiyah! Kya tum ne namaz churai ya bhool gae? Phir jab unhon ne is ke baad namaz padhai to Ummul Quran ke baad wali surah ke liye Bismillahir Rahmanir Rahim [Fatiha: 1] padhi aur jab sajde ke liye jhukte to takbeer kahi."
"206","[AI-translation] Isma'il bin Ubaid bin Rifa'ah se, apne walid se riwayat hai ke Mu'awiyah Madinah aae aur unhon ne namaz padhai aur Bismillahir Rahmanir Rahim [Fatiha: 1] na padhi, aur jab jhukte aur uthte to takbeer na kahi. To Muhajireen ne jab unhon ne salam phaira aur Ansar ne unhen pukara: Aey Mu'awiyah! Tum ne apni namaz churai, Bismillahir Rahmanir Rahim [Fatiha: 1] kahan hai? Aur takbeer kahan hai jab tum jhukte aur uthte ho? Phir unhon ne unhen doosri namaz padhai aur us mein woh kaha jis par unhon ne etiraz kiya tha."
"207","[AI-translation] Isma'il bin Ubaid bin Rifa'ah se, apne walid se, Mu'awiyah, Muhajireen aur Ansar se isi ki misl ya is ke hum-ma'na jo is ki mukhalifat nahin karta riwayat hai. Aur mera khayal hai yeh sanad pahli sanad se zyada mahfooz hai."
"208","[AI-translation] Nafi' se riwayat hai ke Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) Surah Fatiha aur baad wali surat ke sath Bismillahir Rahmanir Rahim nahin chhodte the."
"209","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai bayan farmate hain ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam), Abu Bakr, Umar aur Usman (Raziyallahu anhum) qiraat ka aaghaz Alhamdu lillahi Rabbil Aalameen [Fatiha: 2] ke sath karte the."
"210","[AI-translation] Sa'id bin Jubair se 'Aur beshak ham ne tumhen saat dohrai jane wali aur Quran azeem diya [Hijr: 87]' ke bare mein riwayat hai, unhon ne farmaya: Woh Ummul Quran hai. Mere walid ne kaha: Aur Sa'id bin Jubair ne mujhe mukammal Surah Fatiha padh kar sunai phir farmaya: Bismillahir Rahmanir Rahim is ki saatwin aayat hai. Sa'id kahte hain: Jis tarah main ne tumhen padh kar sunai hai isi tarah Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne padhi aur farmaya: Bismillahir Rahmanir Rahim is ki saatwin aayat hai. Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne farmaya: Allah ne is ko tumhare liye apne han mahfooz rakha aur tum se pahle kisi ko bhi nahin di."
"211","[AI-translation] Ubadah bin Samit (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Is shakhs ki namaz nahin jis ne namaz mein Surah Fatiha na padhi.'"
"212","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Har woh namaz jis mein Ummul Kitab Fatiha na padhi jae woh naqis hai, woh naqis hai.'"
"213","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab imam Aameen kahe to tum bhi Aameen kaho! Jis ki Aameen farishton ki Aameen se mil gai, is ke sabiqa sare sagheera gunah muaf kar diye gae.'"
"214","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab imam kahe to tum Aameen kaho! Jis ki Aameen farishton ki Aameen se mil gai is ke sabiqa sare sagheera gunah muaf kar diye gae.'"
"215","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab tum mein se koi Aameen kahta hai to farishte bhi aasman mein Aameen kahte hain aur jis ki Aameen ki farishton ki Aameen se muwafiqat ho gai is ke sabiqa sare sagheera gunah muaf kar diye gae.'"
"216","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab imam Aameen kahe to tum bhi Aameen kaho, jis ki Aameen farishton ki Aameen se mil gai is ke pichhle sare gunah muaf kar diye gae.' Ibn Shihab Zuhri farmate hain Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Aameen kahte the."
"217","[AI-translation] Ata se riwayat hai woh bayan farmate hain main Abdullah bin Zubair (Raziyallahu anhuma) ki taraf se muqarrar karda imamon aur in ke baad ke imamon se sunta ke woh Aameen kahte aur in ke muqtadi bhi Aameen kahte yahan tak ke masjid goonj uthti."
"218","[AI-translation] Ata se riwayat hai bayan farmate hain main aima ko sunta aur Ibn Zubair (Raziyallahu anhuma) ka zikr kiya aur in ke baad ke daur ka ke woh imam Aameen kahte aur in ke muqtadi bhi Aameen kahte yahan tak ke masjid goonj uthti."
"219","[AI-translation] Nafi' se riwayat hai ke Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) jab akele chaar rak'at padhte to har rak'at mein Surah Fatiha aur Quran se ek surah padhte. Nafi' kahte hain, aur baaz daf'a farzi namaz ki ek hi rak'at mein do, teen suraten bhi padhte."
"220","[AI-translation] Rifa'ah bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se suna Aap farma rahe the: 'Jab tum mein se koi namaz ke liye khada ho to is tarah wuzu kare jis tarah Allah ne is ko hukm diya hai, phir takbeer kahe, agar use Quran yaad hai to is se padhe, aur agar use kuch bhi Quran nahin aata to Allah Ta'ala ki hamd bayan kare, aur Allahu Akbar kah kar ruku' kare yahan tak ke itminan se ruku' kar le, phir khada ho yahan tak ke itminan se khada ho jae, phir sajda kare yahan tak ke itminan se sajda ho, phir apna sar uthae aur baithe yahan tak ke itminan se baith jae, jis ne is mein kami ki beshak woh namaz mein kami kar raha hai.'"
"221","[AI-translation] Rifa'ah bin Rafi' (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi masjid mein dakhil hua aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke qareeb namaz padhne laga. Jab us ne namaz poori ki to woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur Aap ko salam kiya, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Apni namaz lautao, kyunke tu ne namaz nahin padhi.' Woh aadmi khada hua aur is tarah namaz padhi jaise pahle padhi thi, to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne phir farmaya: 'Apni namaz lautao, kyunke tu ne namaz nahin padhi.' Us ne kaha: Aey Allah ke Rasool (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam)! Mujhe sikhayen main kaise namaz padhun? Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab tu qibla rukh khada ho to Allahu Akbar kah, phir Surah Fatiha aur Quran se utna padh jitna Allah ne tera muqaddar kar diya hai, aur jab ruku' kare to apni hatheliyon ko ghutnon par rakh, aur apne ruku' ko itminan se kar aur apni kamar phaila de, aur jab tu uthe to apni peeth seedhi kar aur sar ko utha yahan tak ke haddiyan jodon par laut aaen. Aur jab tu sajda kare to itminan se sajda kar aur jab uthe to apni baen raan par baith ja, phir isi tarah har ruku' aur sajda itminan ke sath kar.'"
"222","[AI-translation] Rifa'ah bin Rafi' (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek aadmi se kaha: 'Jab tu ruku' kare to apni hatheliyon ko ghutnon par rakh aur ruku' mein thahar aur jab tu uthe to apni peeth ko seedha kar aur apna sar utha yahan tak ke har haddi apne jod par aa jae.'"
"223","[AI-translation] Nu'man bin Murrah se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Tum sharabi, zani aur chor ke mutalliq kya kahte ho?' Aur yeh baat in jurm ki hudood ke nuzool se pahle ki hai. Sahaba kiram (Raziyallahu anhum) ne kaha: Allah aur is ka Rasool zyada behtar jante hain, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Yeh buraiyan hain aur in mein saza hai aur sab se bura chor namaz ka chor hai.' Phir hadees aage bayan ki."
"224","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Mujhe ruku' aur sajde ki haalat mein Quran ki qiraat se mana kiya gaya hai. Lehaza ruku' mein Rab ki azmat bayan karo, aur sajde mein koshish aur justuju se dua karo. Kyunke woh is laiq hai ke tumhari dua qabool kar li jae.'"
"225","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se marvi hai woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Khabardar! Mujhe ruku' aur sajda ki haalat mein Quran ki qiraat se rok diya gaya hai, ruku' mein Rab ki azmat bayan karo aur sajda mein khoob dua mango, tumhari dua qabooliyat ke zyada laiq hogi.'"
"226","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai bayan farmate hain Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab ruku' karte to padhte: 'Aey Allah! Main ne tere liye ruku' kiya, aur tere liye Islam laya, aur tere sath iman laya aur tu hi mera Rab hai, mere kaan, meri aankhen, aur meri haddiyan aur mere baal aur meri jild, aur mere is jism ne jise uthaya hua hai mere qadmon ne, aajizi ikhtiyar ki Allah Rabbul Aalameen ke liye.'"
"227","[AI-translation] Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab ruku' karte to padhte: 'Aey Allah! Main ne tere liye ruku' kiya, aur tujh par iman laya, aur teri ita'at qabool ki aur tu hi mera Rab hai, aajizi ikhtiyar ki tere liye mere kaan, meri aankhon, mere dimagh, meri haddiyon aur mere jism ne jise mere qadmon ne uthaya hua hai, Allah ke liye jo Rabbul Aalameen hai.'"
"228","[AI-translation] Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai unhon ne farmaya: 'Jab tu ruku' kare to padh! Aey Allah! Main ne tere liye ruku' kiya, aur tere liye aajizi ki, aur teri ita'at qabool ki aur tujh par iman laya, aur tujh par hi bharosa kiya to tera ruku' mukammal ho gaya.'"
"229","[AI-translation] Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab farzi namaz mein ruku' se sar uthate to padhte: 'Aey Allah! Aey hamare Parwardigar! Tere liye hi har qism ki tareef hai aasmanon aur zameen ke bharao ke barabar aur is cheez ke bharao ke barabar jise tu chahe.'"
"230","[AI-translation] Aun bin Abdullah bin Uqbah bin Mas'ud (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab tum mein se koi ruku' kare aur teen martaba padhe to is ka ruku' mukammal ho gaya aur yeh kam se kam hai, aur jab sajda kare aur teen martaba padha to is ka sajda mukammal ho gaya aur yeh kam se kam hai.'"
"231","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab sajda karte to padhte: 'Aey Allah! Tere liye main ne sajda kiya, aur teri ita'at qabool ki aur tujh par iman laya aur tu hi mera Rab hai. Sajda raiz hua mera chehra is hasti ke liye jis ne is ko paida kiya aur is ke kaanon aur aankhon ke shigaf banae, bada babarkat hai Allah jo behtareen khaliq hai.'"
"232","[AI-translation] Muhammad al-Baqir se riwayat bayan farmate hain ke lakdiyan chunne wale log Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aae aur unhon ne kaha: Aey Allah ke Rasool! Ham hamesha safar mein rahte hain, ham namaz ka kya karen? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Ruku' ke liye teen tasbeehat aur sajda mein bhi teen tasbeehat padha karo.'"
"233","[AI-translation] Aun bin Abdullah bin Uqbah bin Mas'ud (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab tum mein se koi ruku' kare aur teen daf'a padhe to is ka ruku' mukammal ho gaya aur yeh kam se kam tadad hai, aur jab sajda kiya aur teen daf'a padha to is ka sajda mukammal ho gaya aur yeh tadad kam se kam hai.'"
"234","[AI-translation] Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke woh do sajdon ke darmiyan padhte: 'Aey Allah! Mujhe muaf kar de, mujh par raham farma, mujhe hidayat de, mere nuqs door farma.'"
"235","[AI-translation] Ja'far bin Muhammad se, apne walid se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Jab Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) tak Bi'r Ma'unah walon ke qatl ki khabar pahunchi to Aap pandrah raaten khade rahe, jab bhi Subah ki aakhri rak'at se apna sar uthate to kahte: Allah ne us ki sun li jis ne Us ki hamd ki, aey hamare Rab! Tere liye hamd hai. Aey Allah! Aisa kar, phir unhon ne lambi dua ka zikr kiya, phir takbeer kahi aur sajda kiya."
"236","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne subah ki namaz mein doosri rak'at ke ruku' se sar uthaya to yeh dua ki: 'Aey Allah! Waleed bin Waleed, Salamah bin Hisham, Ayyash bin Abi Rabi'ah aur Makkah mein maujood deegar kamzor Musalmanon ko nijaat de. Aey Allah! Qabeela Mudar ke logon par apni pakad sakht kar de. Aey Allah! In par Yusuf (Alaihissalam) ke zamana jaisa qahat nazil farma.'"
"237","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne subah ki namaz mein qunoot kiya to yeh dua padhi: 'Aey Allah! Waleed bin Waleed, Salamah bin Hisham, aur Ayyash bin Abi Rabi'ah ko nijaat de.'"
"238","[AI-translation] Nafi' se riwayat hai ke Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) kisi namaz mein bhi qunoot nahin karte the."
"239","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat bayan karte ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko apne saat a'za par sajda karne ka hukm diya gaya. Donon hathon, donon ghutnon, paon ki ungliyon ke atraf, aur peshani par, aur apne baal aur kapdon ko sametne se mana kiya gaya. Ibn Tawus ne yeh alfaz zyada bayan kiye hain ke apna hath peshani aur naak par rakha, Ibn Tawus kahte hain mere walid naak aur peshani ko ek hi shumar karte the."
"240","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko saat a'za par sajda ka hukm diya gaya hai aur apne baal aur kapdon ko sajda mein sametne se rok diya gaya hai."
"241","[AI-translation] Abbas bin Abdul Muttalib se riwayat hai unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se suna Aap farma rahe the. 'Jab banda sajda karta hai to is ke sath saat a'za bhi sajda karte hain: Is ka chehra, is ki hatheliyan, is ke ghutne aur is ke donon qadam.'"
"242","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko saat a'za par sajda karne ka hukm diya gaya. Is mein apni donon hatheliyon aur apne donon ghutnon ka bhi zikr kiya."
"243","[AI-translation] Nafi' se riwayat hai ke Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) jab sajda karte to apni hatheliyon ko is jagah rakhte jis jagah apna chehra rakhte. Nafi' kahte hain: Main ne sakht thandak mein Aap ko dekha ke Aap apni chadar se hath nikalte aur unhen zameen par rakhte."
"244","[AI-translation] Hasan se riwayat hai woh apni maa se riwayat karte hain ke unhon ne farmaya: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki biwi Umm Salamah (Raziyallahu anha) ko dekha ke woh chamde ke bane hue takiya par sajda kartin."
"245","[AI-translation] Mujahid se riwayat hai bayan farmate hain ek banda Allah ke sab se zyada qareeb haalat sajda mein hota hai, kya Aap ne Allah ke qaul ki taraf ruju' nahin dekha: 'Karo aur taqarrub hasil karo', yani sajda karo aur Allah ka taqarrub hasil karo."
"246","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Aqram Khuza'i (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai woh farmate hain main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko Namrah ke maidan mein sajda karte dekha to main ne Aap ki baghlon ki safedi dekhi."
"247","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Aqram Khuza'i (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai farmate hain main ne Namrah ke maidan mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko sajda karte dekha to main ne Aap ki baghlon ki safedi dekhi."
"248","[AI-translation] Maimunah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab sajda karte to agar bakri ka bachcha Aap ke neeche se guzarna chahta to guzar jata, is wajah se ke Aap kohniyan kushada rakhte."
"249","[AI-translation] Abu Qilabah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Malik bin Huwairis hamare paas aae aur hamari masjid mein namaz padhi. Unhon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Main namaz is liye nahin padh raha ke mujhe namaz padhna hai, lekin main tumhen dikhana chahta hun ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko kaise namaz padhte dekha. Phir unhon ne zikr kiya ke woh pahli rak'at se khade hote, aur jab uthne ka irada karte, main ne kaha: Kaise? Unhon ne kaha: Meri is namaz ki tarah."
"250","[AI-translation] Abu Qilabah se isi ki misl riwayat hai siwae is ke ke unhon ne kaha: Malik jab pahli rak'at mein aakhri sajde se apna sar uthate phir seedhe baithte to zameen par sahara le kar khade hote."
"251","[AI-translation] Abu Ubaidah bin Abdullah bin Mas'ud se, apne walid se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) do rak'aton mein goya angaron par hote. Main ne kaha: Yahan tak ke khade ho jaen? Unhon ne kaha: Woh yahi chahte hain."
"252","[AI-translation] Abbas bin Sahl se, Abu Humaid Sa'idi se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab donon sajdon mein baithe to apni baen taang modte aur us par baithte aur daen qadam khada rakhte. Phir jab chaar rak'aton mein baithe to apni donon taangen raan se hata lete aur apne baithne ki jagah ko zameen se mila lete aur apni daen raan khadi rakhte."
"253","[AI-translation] Ali bin Abdur Rahman Mu'awi se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Ibn Umar ne kankriyon se khelte hue dekha. Jab farigh hue to mana farmaya aur kaha: Waisa karo jaisa Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) karte the. To main ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) kaise karte the? Unhon ne kaha: Jab namaz mein baithe to apni daen hatheli ko daen raan par rakhte, apni tamam ungliyan band kar lete, aur anguthe ke sath wali ungli se ishara karte, aur apni baen hatheli ko baen raan par rakhte."
"254","[AI-translation] Sa'id bin Jubair aur Tawus se, Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamen tashahhud is tarah sikhate jaise hamen Quran sikhate. Aap farmate: 'Tamam tazeemen, barkaten, namazen aur pakeezgiyan Allah ke liye hain. Aey Nabi! Aap par salam ho aur Allah ki rahmat aur Us ki barkaten hon. Ham par aur Allah ke naik bandon par salam ho. Main gawahi deta hun ke Allah ke siwa koi ma'bud nahin, aur main gawahi deta hun ke Muhammad Allah ke Rasool hain.'"
"255","[AI-translation] Abdur Rahman bin Abd Qari se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Hazrat Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ko mimbar par logon ko tashahhud sikhate suna aur woh kahte: Kaho: Tamam tazeemen Allah ke liye, pakeezgiyan Allah ke liye, pakeezgiyan aur namazen Allah ke liye. Aey Nabi! Aap par salam ho aur Allah ki rahmat aur Us ki barkaten hon. Ham par aur Allah ke naik bandon par salam ho. Main gawahi deta hun ke Allah ke siwa koi ma'bud nahin, aur main gawahi deta hun ke Muhammad Us ke bande aur Us ke Rasool hain."
"256","[AI-translation] Ata se riwayat hai woh bayan farmate hain main ne Ibn Abbas aur Ibn Zubair ko suna ke woh tashahhud mein ikhtilaf nahin karte the."
"257","[AI-translation] Abu Salamah bin Abdur Rahman se, Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Ham Aap par kaise durood bhejen, yani namaz mein? To Aap ne farmaya: 'Kaho: Aey Allah! Muhammad aur Aal Muhammad par rahmat bhej jaise Tune Ibrahim par rahmat bheji, aur Muhammad aur Aal Muhammad par barkat bhej jaise Tune Ibrahim par barkat bheji. Phir mujh par salam bhejo.'"
"258","[AI-translation] Abdur Rahman bin Abi Laila se, Ka'b bin Ujrah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap namaz mein farmate: 'Aey Allah! Muhammad aur Aal Muhammad par rahmat bhej jaise Tune Ibrahim aur Aal Ibrahim par rahmat bheji, aur Muhammad aur Aal Muhammad par barkat bhej jaise Tune Ibrahim aur Aal Ibrahim par barkat bheji. Beshak Tu qabil tareef buzurg hai.'"
"259","[AI-translation] Aamir bin Sa'd se, apne walid se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap namaz mein jab farigh hote to daen aur baen taraf salam phairte."
"260","[AI-translation] Aamir bin Sa'd se, apne walid se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se isi ki misl riwayat hai."
"261","[AI-translation] Abdul Wahhab bin Bukht se, Wasilah bin Asqa' se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) daen aur baen taraf salam phairte yahan tak ke Aap ke donon rukhsar nazar aate."
"262","[AI-translation] Abbas bin Sahl bin Sa'd se, apne walid se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab apni namaz se farigh hote to daen aur baen taraf salam phairte."
"263","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Yahya bin Hibban se, apne chacha Wasi' bin Hibban se, Ibn Umar se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap daen aur baen taraf salam phairte."
"264","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Yahya se, apne chacha Wasi' bin Hibban se riwayat hai, unhon ne ek martaba kaha: Ibn Umar se, aur ek martaba: Abdullah bin Zaid se ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) daen aur baen taraf salam phairte."
"265","[AI-translation] Ibn Qibtiyah se, Jabir bin Samurah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath the. Jab Aap salam phairte, aur unhon ne kaha: Ham mein se har ek daen aur baen taraf ishara karta: Assalamu alaikum, aur apne hath se daen aur baen taraf ishara karta. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Tumhen kya hai ke tum apne hathon se ishara karte ho goya woh sarkash ghodon ki dummen hain? Kya tum mein se har ek ke liye kafi nahin ya har ek ke liye yahi kafi hai ke apna hath apni raan par rakhe, phir daen aur baen taraf salam kare: Assalamu alaikum wa rahmatullah.'"
"266","[AI-translation] Abu Ma'bad se, Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki namaz ke khatm hone ko takbeer se pahchanta tha. Unhon ne kaha: Amr bin Dinar ne kaha: Phir main ne is ka zikr Abu Ma'bad se baad mein kiya to unhon ne kaha: Main ne tumhen yeh bayan nahin kiya. Amr ne kaha: Tum ne mujhe yeh bayan kiya tha. Unhon ne kaha: Woh Ibn Abbas ke ghulamon mein se sab se sachche the. Shafi'i ne farmaya: Goya woh use bayan karne ke baad bhool gae."
"267","[AI-translation] Abu Zubair se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Abdullah bin Zubair ko kahte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab apni namaz se salam phairte to apni buland awaz se farmate: 'Allah ke siwa koi ma'bud nahin, woh akela hai, Us ka koi shareek nahin, Us ki badshahat hai aur Us ki tareef hai, aur woh har cheez par qadir hai. Gunaah se bachna aur neki ki taqat Allah hi se hai. Ham Us ke siwa kisi ki ibadat nahin karte. Us ki nemat hai, Us ka fazl hai aur Us ki achchi sana hai. Allah ke siwa koi ma'bud nahin, Us ke liye deen ko khalis karte hue agarche kafir napasand karen.'"
"268","[AI-translation] Hindun bint Haris bin Abdullah bin Abi Rabi'ah se, Umm Salamah zauja Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab apni namaz se salam phairte to aurten Aap ke salam mukammal karne par khadi ho jatin, aur Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) apni jagah thodi der thehre rahte. Ibn Shihab ne kaha: Ham samajhte hain ke Aap ka woh theharna, Wallahu a'lam, taake aurten door ho jaen qabl is ke ke unhen qaum ke jane walon mein se koi pae."
"269","[AI-translation] Abu Aubar Harisi se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) ko kahte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) namaz se daen aur baen taraf mudte."
"270","[AI-translation] Sulaiman bin Mehran se, Umarah se, Aswad se, Abdullah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Tum mein se koi shaitan ke liye apni namaz mein se hissa na banae ke woh samjhe ke us par lazim hai ke woh daen taraf hi se hate. Beshak main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko aksar baen taraf se hate dekha."
"271","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jama'at ki namaz akele ki namaz se sattais darje afzal hai.'"
"272","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jama'at ki namaz tum mein se kisi ki akele namaz se pachchis hisson se afzal hai.'"
"273","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar se riwayat hai ke unhon ne iqamat suni jabke woh Baqi' mein the to masjid ki taraf jaldi se aae."
"274","[AI-translation] A'raj se, Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Us zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai! Beshak main ne irada kiya ke lakdiyon ka hukm dun phir woh ikatthi ki jaen, phir namaz ka hukm dun phir us ke liye azan kahi jae, phir ek aadmi ko hukm dun phir woh logon ki imamat kare, phir main un aadmiyon ki taraf jaon phir in ke gharon ko in par aag laga dun. Us zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai! Agar un mein se koi janta ke woh charbi wali haddi ya do achchi bakriyan paega to woh isha mein zaroor hazir hota.'"
"275","[AI-translation] Abdur Rahman bin Harmalah se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Hamare aur munafiqon ke darmiyan isha aur subah mein hazri hai, woh in donon ki taqat nahin rakhte' ya is jaise."
"276","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) muazzin ko hukm dete jab thandi hawa wali raat hoti ke woh kahe: 'Khabardar! Sawariyon par namaz padho.'"
"277","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar se riwayat hai ke ek thandi hawa wali raat mein azan kahi gai to unhon ne kaha: 'Khabardar! Sawariyon par namaz padho.' Phir unhon ne kaha: Beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) muazzin ko hukm dete jab thandi barish wali raat hoti ke woh kahe: 'Khabardar! Sawariyon par namaz padho.'"
"278","[AI-translation] Nafi' se, Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) apne munadi ko barsaat wali raat aur thandi hawa wali raat mein hukm dete: 'Khabardar! Apni sawariyon par namaz padho.'"
"279","[AI-translation] Zaid bin Aslam se, Banu Dail ke ek aadmi se jinhen Busr bin Mihjan kaha jata hai, apne walid Mihjan se riwayat hai ke woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath ek majlis mein the phir namaz ke liye azan kahi gai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) khade hue aur namaz padhi, jabke Mihjan apni majlis mein the. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: 'Tumhen logon ke sath namaz padhne se kis ne roka? Kya tum Musalman nahin ho?' Unhon ne kaha: Kyun nahin, Ya Rasulullah! Lekin main apne ghar walon ke sath namaz padh chuka tha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab tum aao to logon ke sath namaz padho, agarche tum padh chuke ho.'"
"280","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar se riwayat hai ke unhon ne farmaya: Jis ne maghrib aur subah padhi phir unhen imam ke sath paya to unhen na dohraye."
"281","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah se riwayat hai ke Mu'az ne apni qaum ki Atamah mein imamat ki to Surah Baqarah se aaghaz kiya. To in ke peeche se ek aadmi alag ho gaya aur akele namaz padhi. Phir is ka zikr Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kiya gaya. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Mu'az se farmaya: 'Kya tum fitna dalne wale ho, kya tum fitna dalne wale ho? Falan surah aur falan surah padho.'"
"282","[AI-translation] Jabir se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se isi ki misl riwayat hai. Aur us ne doosri hadees mein kaha: Sufyan ne kaha: To main ne is ka zikr Amr se kiya to unhon ne kaha: Woh is jaise hain."
"283","[AI-translation] A'raj se, Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab tum mein se koi logon ko namaz padhae to use halki padhani chahiye, kyunke in mein beemar aur kamzor hote hain. Jab woh apne liye padhe to jitna chahe lambi kare.'"
"284","[AI-translation] Hammam bin Haris se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Huzaifah ne hamen oonchi dukan par imamat karai. Phir woh aae aur us par sajda kiya to Abu Mas'ud Badri ne unhen khaincha aur Huzaifah ne in ki pairwi ki. Jab namaz se farigh hue to Abu Sa'id ne kaha: Kya is se mana nahin kiya gaya tha? To Huzaifah ne kaha: Kya tum ne mujhe tumhari pairwi karte nahin dekha?"
"285","[AI-translation] Ishaq bin Abdullah bin Abi Talhah se, Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke in ki dadi Mulaikah ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko khane ki dawat di jo unhon ne Aap ke liye banaya tha, to Aap ne us mein se khaya. Phir Aap ne farmaya: 'Khade ho jao, main tumhen namaz padhaunga.' Anas ne kaha: To ham apni chaatai ki taraf khade hue jo purani hone ki wajah se kali ho gai thi. To main ne us par pani chhidka. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) us par khade hue, aur main aur yateem Aap ke peeche saf mein khade hue, jabke budhiya hamare peeche thin."
"286","[AI-translation] Anas se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne aur yateem ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke peeche hamare ghar mein namaz padhi, jabke Umm Sulaim hamare peeche thin."
"287","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke in ki dadi Mulaikah ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko khane ki dawat di jo unhon ne Aap ke liye banaya tha, to Aap ne us mein se khaya. Phir Aap ne farmaya: 'Khade ho jao, main tumhare sath namaz padhunga.' Anas ne kaha: To main apni chaatai ki taraf khada hua jo purani hone ki wajah se kali ho gai thi. To main ne us par pani chhidka. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) us par khade hue, aur main aur yateem Aap ke peeche saf mein khade hue jabke budhiya hamare peeche thin. Phir Aap ne hamen do rak'aten padhain phir wapas tashreef le gae."
"288","[AI-translation] Ishaq bin Abdullah bin Abi Talhah se riwayat hai ke unhon ne apne chacha Anas bin Malik ko kahte suna: Main ne aur hamare yateem ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke peeche namaz padhi, jabke Umm Sulaim hamare peeche thin."
"289","[AI-translation] Hilal bin Yasaf se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ziyad bin Abi Ja'd ne mera hath pakda aur mujhe Raqqah mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke Sahaba mein se ek buzurg ke samne khada kiya jinhen Wabisah bin Ma'bad kaha jata hai. To unhon ne kaha: Mujhe inhon ne khabar di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek aadmi ko saf ke peeche akele namaz padhte dekha to namaz dohraye ka hukm diya."
"290","[AI-translation] Salih Maula Tau'amah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Hurairah ko masjid ki chhat par akele imam ki namaz ke sath namaz padhte dekha."
"291","[AI-translation] Salih bin Ibrahim se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Anas bin Malik ko Humaid bin Abdur Rahman bin Auf ke gharon mein juma ki namaz padhte dekha, aur unhon ne masjid mein imam ki namaz ke sath namaz padhi jabke Humaid ke gharon aur masjid ke darmiyan rasta tha."
"292","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se, apne walid se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Imam zamanat dene wale hain aur muazzin amanatdar hain. To Allah imamon ko hidayat de aur muazzinon ko bakhsh de."
"293","[AI-translation] Abu Salih se, Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) tak pahunchate hain: 'Imam zamanat dene wala hai aur muazzin amanatdar hai. Aey Allah! Imamon ko hidayat de aur muazzinon ko bakhsh de.'"
"294","[AI-translation] Abu Qilabah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Abu Sulaiman Malik bin Huwairis ne hamen bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ham se farmaya: 'Namaz padho jaise tum ne mujhe namaz padhte dekha. Aur jab namaz ka waqt ho to tum mein se ek tumhen azan kahe, aur tum mein se bada tumhari imamat kare.'"
"295","[AI-translation] Qasim bin Abdur Rahman se, Ibn Mas'ud (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Sunnat mein se hai ke in ki imamat ghar ka malik hi kare."
"296","[AI-translation] Ata se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ubaid bin Umair ko kahte suna: Makkah ke ird gird ek jama'at jama hui, unhon ne kaha: Mera khayal hai unhon ne kaha: Yahan wadi ke upari hisse mein, aur hajj mein. Unhon ne kaha: To namaz ka waqt hua, phir Aal Abu Sa'ib mein se ek aadmi aage badha jis ki zaban ajami thi. Unhon ne kaha: To Miswar bin Makhramah ne use peeche hataya aur ghair ko aage kiya. To yeh baat Umar bin Khattab tak pahunchi, aur unhon ne use kuch na kaha yahan tak ke woh Madinah aae. Jab woh Madinah aae to unhon ne use is se pahchana. To Miswar ne kaha: Mujhe mohlat den Aey Ameerul Momineen! Beshak woh aadmi ajami zaban tha aur woh hajj mein tha, to mujhe khadsha hua ke baaz haji is ki qiraat sunen aur is ki ujmat ko le len. To unhon ne kaha: Tum use wahin le gae. To main ne kaha: Han. To unhon ne kaha: Tum ne durust kiya."
"297","[AI-translation] Nafi' se riwayat hai ke Ibn Umar Mina mein Ibn Zubair ki ladai mein alag rahe, jabke Hajjaj Mina mein tha, phir unhon ne Hajjaj ke sath namaz padhi."
"298","[AI-translation] Ja'far bin Muhammad se riwayat hai ke Hasan aur Husain Marwan ke peeche namaz padhte. Unhon ne kaha: Phir unhon ne kaha: Kya woh donon jab apne gharon ko wapas jate to namaz padhte? To unhon ne kaha: Nahin, Allah ki qasam! Woh donon imamon ki namaz par izafa nahin karte the."
"299","[AI-translation] Mahmud bin Rabi' se riwayat hai ke Itban bin Malik apni qaum ki imamat karte jabke woh nabina the. Aur unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kaha: Kabhi andhera, barish aur sailab hota hai, jabke main nabina aadmi hun. To Aey Allah ke Rasool! Mere ghar mein kisi jagah namaz padh den jise main namaz ki jagah bana lun. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) tashreef lae aur farmaya: 'Tum kahan chahte ho ke main namaz padhun?' To unhon ne ghar ki ek jagah ki taraf ishara kiya, phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us mein namaz padhi."
"300","[AI-translation] Mahmud bin Rabi' se riwayat hai ke Itban bin Malik apni qaum ki imamat karte jabke woh nabina the."
"301","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Ubaidullah bin Abi Mulaikah se riwayat hai ke woh Aishah Ummul Momineen ke paas wadi ke upari hisse mein aate, woh aur Ubaid bin Umair aur Miswar bin Makhramah, aur bahut se log, phir in ki imamat Abu Amr Maula Aishah karte, jabke Abu Amr us waqt in ke ghulam the jo aazad nahin hue the. Unhon ne kaha: Woh Banu Muhammad bin Abi Bakr aur Urwah ke imam the."
"302","[AI-translation] Nafi' se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Madinah ke ek muhalle ki masjid mein namaz khadi ki gai, jabke Ibn Umar ka us masjid ke qareeb zameen thi jis par woh kaam karte. Us masjid ke imam in ke ghulam the, aur us ghulam aur is ke sathiyon ka maskan wahin tha. Unhon ne kaha: Jab Abdullah ne unhen suna to woh in ke sath namaz mein hazir hone aae. To masjid ke malik ghulam ne in se kaha: Aage badhen aur namaz padhaen. To Abdullah ne farmaya: Tum apni masjid mein mujh se zyada namaz padhane ke haqdar ho. Phir ghulam ne namaz padhai."
"303","[AI-translation] Ammar Duhni se, in ki qaum ki ek aurat se jinhen Hujairah kaha jata hai, Umm Salamah se riwayat hai ke unhon ne in ki imamat ki aur darmiyan mein khadi huin."
"304","[AI-translation] Amr bin Dinar se, Jabir se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mu'az Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath isha ki namaz padhte phir apni qaum ki taraf jate aur unhen padhate, woh in ke liye nafl aur in ke liye farz isha hoti. Rabi' ne kaha: Mujh se kaha gaya: Woh Ibn Juraij se hai, jabke Ibn Juraij mere paas nahin."
"305","[AI-translation] Ubaidullah bin Miqsam se, Jabir bin Abdullah Ansari se riwayat hai ke Mu'az bin Jabal Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath isha ki namaz padhte, phir apni qaum ki taraf wapas ja kar unhen isha ki imamat karte, woh in ke liye nafl hoti."
"306","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ghode par sawar hue phir us se gir gae aur Aap ki daen karwat chhil gai. Phir Aap ne namazon mein se ek namaz baithe hue padhi, to ham ne Aap ke sath baithe hue namaz padhi. Jab farigh hue to farmaya: 'Imam is liye banaya gaya hai ke is ki pairwi ki jae. Jab woh khade ho kar namaz padhe to tum khade ho kar padho, jab woh ruku' kare to tum ruku' karo, jab woh uthe to tum utho, jab woh kahe: Allah ne us ki sun li jis ne Us ki hamd ki, to tum kaho: Aey hamare Rab! Tere liye hamd hai, aur jab woh baithe hue namaz padhe to tum sab baithe hue padho.'"
"307","[AI-translation] Hisham bin Urwah se, apne walid se, Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se isi ki misl riwayat hai."
"308","[AI-translation] Hisham bin Urwah se, apne walid se, Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mere ghar mein namaz padhi jabke Aap beemar the. To Aap ne baithe hue namaz padhi aur logon ne Aap ke peeche khade ho kar padhi. To Aap ne unhen ishare se baithne ka hukm diya. Jab farigh hue to farmaya: 'Imam is liye banaya gaya hai ke is ki pairwi ki jae. Jab woh ruku' kare to tum ruku' karo, jab woh uthe to tum utho, aur jab woh baithe hue namaz padhe to tum baithe hue padho.'"
"309","[AI-translation] Jabir se riwayat hai ke woh use rukhsat karne nikle jabke woh beemar tha. Phir us ne baithe hue namaz padhi aur unhon ne is ke peeche baithe hue padhi."
"310","[AI-translation] Hisham bin Urwah se, apne walid se, Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Hazrat Abu Bakr ko logon ki imamat ka hukm diya. Phir Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne khiffat mahsoos ki aur aae aur Hazrat Abu Bakr ke pahlu mein baithe. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Hazrat Abu Bakr ki imamat ki jabke Aap baithe hue the, aur Hazrat Abu Bakr ne logon ki imamat ki jabke woh khade hue the."
"311","[AI-translation] Ubaid bin Umair Laithi bayan karte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) ko logon ko subah ki namaz padhane ka hukm diya, aur Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) ne takbeer kahi, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne kuch afaqa mahsoos kiya, Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) khade hue aur safon se aage nikal aae, Ubaid kahte hain Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) jab namaz padhte to kisi janib mutawajjeh nahin hote the, jab Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) ne apne peeche kuch mahsoos kiya, aur pahchan liya ke is jagah par Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke ilawa aur koi nahin aasakta, wapas saf ki taraf peeche hue to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen in ki jagah lauta diya. Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) in ke pahlu mein baith gae, aur Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) khade the, hatta ke jab Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) namaz se farigh hue to farmaya: Aey Allah ke Rasool (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam)! Mere khayal mein Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) tandrust ho gae, aur yeh din kharija ki beti ka tha, Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) apne ghar aagae, aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) apni jagah par hujre ke ek janib baith kar logon ko fitnon se darate rahe, Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Logon ko nahin chahiye ke har baat mein meri tarah amal karen kyunke main halal nahin karta magar woh jo Allah ne Apni Kitab mein halal kiya, aur haram nahin karta magar woh jo Allah ne Apni Kitab mein haram kiya. Aey Fatimah bint Rasulullah! Aey Safiyah amma Rasulullah! Allah ke han jo hai is ke liye amal karo, kyunke main tumhare liye Allah ke muqable mein kuch kaam nahin aaunga.'"
"312","[AI-translation] Hisham bin Urwah se, apne walid se, Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) beemar the to Hazrat Abu Bakr ko logon ki imamat ka hukm diya. Phir Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne khiffat mahsoos ki aur aae aur Hazrat Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) ke pahlu mein baithe. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Hazrat Abu Bakr ki imamat ki jabke Aap baithe hue the, aur Hazrat Abu Bakr ne logon ki imamat ki jabke woh khade hue the."
"313","[AI-translation] Ubaid bin Umair se ek doosri sanad se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se sabiqa hadees ke hum-ma'na jo is ke khilaf nahin riwayat hai."
"314","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) apni beemari mein bahar tashreef lae aur Hazrat Abu Bakr ke paas aae jabke woh khade logon ki imamat kar rahe the. To Hazrat Abu Bakr peeche hate, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen ishara farmaya ke jaise ho waise raho. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Hazrat Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) ke pahlu mein baithe. To Hazrat Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki namaz ke sath namaz padhte aur log Hazrat Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) ki namaz ke sath padhte."
"315","[AI-translation] Urwah se, Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se isi ke hum-ma'na jo is ke khilaf nahin aur is se zyada wazeh riwayat hai, aur unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) in ke pahlu mein khade ho kar namaz padhte."
"316","[AI-translation] Ubaid bin Umair se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Siqah ne khabar di, goya woh Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) murad lete hain, phir unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki namaz ka zikr kiya jabke Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) in ke pahlu mein the, Hisham bin Urwah ki apne walid se hadees ki misl."
"317","[AI-translation] Abu Hazim bin Dinar se, Sahl bin Sa'd Sa'idi se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Banu Amr bin Auf ke darmiyan sulah karane ke liye tashreef le gae. Aur asr ka waqt ho gaya, muazzin Hazrat Abu Bakr ke paas aaya aur Hazrat Abu Bakr aage badhe. Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) tashreef lae aur logon ne kasrat se taliyan bajain. Hazrat Abu Bakr namaz mein kisi janib tawajjeh na dete the. Jab logon ne mutawatir taliyan bajana shuru kin to Hazrat Abu Bakr mutawajjeh hue aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko dekha, Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ishare se unhen apni jagah rahne ke liye kaha, Hazrat Abu Bakr ne apne hath utha kar Allah ka shukr ada kiya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen imamat ka aizaz bakhsha, phir Hazrat Abu Bakr peeche hat gae aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne aage badh kar namaz padhai, jab namaz se farigh hue to farmaya: 'Aey Abu Bakr! Jab main ne Aap ko hukm diya tha to Aap apni jagah par kyun na rahe?' Hazrat Abu Bakr ne farmaya: Ibn Abi Quhafa ke liye jaiz nahin ke woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke aage namaz padhae. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Tumhen kya hai, main ne tumhen kasrat se taliyan bajate dekha? Jo namaz mein kisi surat se dochar ho to use Subhan Allah kahna chahiye, kyunke jab woh kahta hai to is ki taraf tawajjeh ki jati hai, aur taliyan bajana aurton ke liye hai.'"
"318","[AI-translation] Abu Salamah se, Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Mardon ke liye tasbeeh hai aur aurton ke liye taliyan bajana hai.'"
"319","[AI-translation] Sahl bin Sa'd Sa'idi (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Banu Amr bin Auf ke darmiyan sulah karane ke liye tashreef le gae. Aur namaz ka waqt ho gaya, muazzin ne Hazrat Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) se kaha: Kya Aap logon ko namaz padhaenge, main iqamat kahun? Hazrat Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: Han, chunacha Hazrat Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) ne namaz shuru kar di, itne mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) tashreef lae to log namaz padh rahe the. Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) logon se guzar kar pahli saf mein aae, logon ne taliyan bajain, Hazrat Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) namaz mein kisi janib tawajjeh na dete the, jab logon ne mutawatir taliyan bajana shuru kin to Hazrat Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) mutawajjeh hue aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko dekha, Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ishara se unhen apni jagah rahne ke liye kaha, Hazrat Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) ne apne hath utha kar Allah ka shukr ada kiya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen imamat ka aizaz bakhsha, phir Hazrat Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) peeche hat gae aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne aage badh kar namaz padhai, jab namaz se farigh hue to farmaya: 'Aey Abu Bakr! Jab main ne Aap ko hukm diya tha to Aap apni jagah par kyun na rahe?' Hazrat Abu Bakr ne farmaya: Ibn Abi Quhafa ke liye jaiz nahin ke woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke aage namaz padhae. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Tumhen kya hai, main ne tumhen kasrat se taliyan bajate dekha? Jo namaz mein kisi surat se dochar ho to use Subhan Allah kahna chahiye, kyunke jab woh kahta hai to is ki taraf tawajjeh ki jati hai, aur taliyan bajana aurton ke liye hai.' Abul Abbas yani Asamm ne kaha: Main ne is hadees ko is jagah nikala, aur woh dohrai hui hai siwae is ke ke is ke alfaz mukhtalif hain, aur is mein zyadati aur kami hai."
"320","[AI-translation] Amir bin Abdullah se, Amr bin Sulaim Zurqi se, Abu Qatadah se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) namaz padhte jabke Aap Umamah bint Abil Aas ko uthae hue hote. Shafi'i ne farmaya: Umamah ka libas bachche ka libas hai."
"321","[AI-translation] Amir bin Abdullah bin Zubair se, Amr bin Sulaim Zurqi se, Abu Qatadah Ansari se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) logon ke sath namaz padhte jabke Aap Umamah bint Zainab ko uthae hue hote. Jab sajda karte to use rakh dete, jab khade hote to use utha lete."
"322","[AI-translation] Amir bin Abdullah bin Zubair se, Amr bin Sulaim Zurqi se, Abu Qatadah Ansari se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) namaz padhte jabke Aap Umamah bint Abil Aas ko uthae hue hote, aur woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki beti ki beti thin. Jab sajda karte to use rakh dete, jab khade hote to use utha lete."
"323","[AI-translation] Ata bin Yasar (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne namazon mein se ek namaz mein takbeer kahi, phir apne hath se ishara farmaya: Thehre raho. Phir wapas aae aur Aap ki jild par pani ka nishan tha."
"324","[AI-translation] Ek doosri sanad se Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se sabiqa hadees ke hum-ma'na riwayat hai."
"325","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Arqam se riwayat hai ke woh ek din apne sathiyon ki imamat kar rahe the, phir apni hajat ke liye gae phir wapas aae aur farmaya: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: 'Jab tum mein se koi hajat pae to use namaz se pahle poora kare.'"
"326","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Arqam se riwayat hai ke woh Makkah ki taraf nikle aur qaum in ke sath thi. Woh in ki imamat karte. Phir namaz khadi ki gai aur unhon ne ek aadmi ko aage kiya aur farmaya: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab namaz khadi ki jae aur tum mein se koi hajat pae to use pahle poora kare.'"
"327","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Buhainah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamen chaar rak'at wali namaz mein do rak'aten padhain phir khade ho gae aur na baithe. To log bhi in ke sath khade ho gae. Jab namaz mukammal ki aur ham in ke salam ka intezar karne lage to unhon ne takbeer kahi phir baithe hue salam se pahle do sajde kiye, phir salam phaira."
"328","[AI-translation] Ibn Buhainah se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) zuhr ki do rak'aton se baghair baithe khade ho gae. Jab namaz mukammal ki to do sajde kiye phir is ke baad salam phaira."
"329","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Buhainah se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamen do rak'aten padhain phir khade ho gae aur na baithe, aur log bhi in ke sath khade ho gae. Jab namaz mukammal ki aur ham in ke salam ka intezar karne lage to unhon ne takbeer kahi, phir baithe hue salam se pahle do sajde kiye."
"330","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke baad mein do rak'aton se phir kar, Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) mud gae, aur Zul Yadain ne Aap se kaha: 'Kya namaz qasr ho gai ya Aap bhool gae, Aey Allah ke Rasool?' To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Kya Zul Yadain sach kahte hain?' To logon ne kaha: Han. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) khade hue aur doosri do rak'aten padhin, phir salam phaira phir takbeer kahi. Phir apne sajde jaise ya is se zyada lamba sajda kiya, phir uthe, phir takbeer kahi phir apne sajde jaise ya is se zyada lamba sajda kiya, phir uthe."
"331","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) farmate hain ke hamen Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne asr ki namaz padhai. Aap ne do rak'aton ke baad salam phair diya, to Zulyadain khade hue aur poocha: 'Aey Allah ke Rasool! Kya namaz kam kar di gai ya Aap bhool gae?' Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) logon ki taraf mude tasdeeq ke liye aur poocha: 'Kya Zulyadain sahih kah raha hai?' Logon ne kaha: 'Han'. Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne baqi namaz mukammal ki phir do sajde baithe baithe salam ke baad kiye."
"332","[AI-translation] Imran bin Husain (Raziyallahu anhu) bayan farmate hain Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne asr ki namaz mein teen rak'at ke baad salam phair diya. Phir khade hue aur hujre mein tashreef le gae. Khirbaq jo lambe hathon wale aadmi the khade hue aur awaz di: 'Aey Allah ke Rasool! Kya namaz kam kar di gai?' Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ghusse mein chadar ghaseet-te hue nikle, logon se poocha to Aap ko bataya gaya ke Aap ne teen rak'aten padhai hain, Aap ne chhodi hui rak'at padhai phir do sajde kiye aur baad mein salam phaira."
"333","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Surah Najm padhi, Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne sajda kiya aur Aap ke sath do aadmiyon ke ilawa sab ne sajda kiya, farmaya: 'In donon ne shohrat chahi.'"
"334","[AI-translation] A'raj se riwayat hai ke Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ne Surah Wan Najmi Iza Hawa padhi to is mein sajda kiya, phir khade ho kar doosri surat tilawat ki."
"335","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Sa'labah bin Su'air se riwayat hai ke Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ne unhen Jabiyah maqam par namaz padhai, to Surah Hajj padhi aur is mein do sajde kiye."
"336","[AI-translation] Abu Salamah bin Abdur Rahman se riwayat hai ke Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) ne in ke liye Surah Iza Samaun Shaqqat padhi aur is mein sajda kiya, jab farigh hue to unhen batlaya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne bhi is mein sajda kiya."
"337","[AI-translation] Ata bin Yasar se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas sajda wali aayat padhi aur sajda kiya to Nabi Akram (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne bhi sajda kiya, phir Aap ke paas doosre ne sajda wali aayat padhi to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne sajda na kiya, is aadmi ne kaha: 'Aey Allah ke Rasool! Falan aadmi ne Aap ke paas sajda wali aayat padhi to Aap ne sajda kiya, aur jab main ne padhi to Aap ne nahin kiya', Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Tu imam tha agar tu sajda karta to main bhi sajda karta.'"
"338","[AI-translation] Zaid bin Sabit (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas Surah Najm padhi to Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne is mein sajda nahin kiya."
"339","[AI-translation] Ibn Mas'ud (Raziyallahu anhu) se marvi hai ke woh Surah Sad mein sajda nahin karte the aur farmate yeh to ek Nabi ki tauba ka zikr hai."
"340","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai bayan farmate hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Makkah aur Madinah ke darmiyan aman ki haalat mein safar kiya Aap Allah ke ilawa kisi se nahin darte the to Aap ne do rak'at namaz padhi. Asamm ne kaha: Mera khayal hai Ibn Abbas meri do kitabon se gir gaya."
"341","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai bayan farmate hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Makkah aur Madinah ke darmiyan aman ki haalat mein safar kiya Aap Allah Ta'ala ke ilawa kisi se nahin darte the, aur Aap do rak'at namaz padhte."
"342","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai bayan farmate hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Makkah aur Madinah ke darmiyan aman ki haalat mein safar kiya Aap Allah ke ilawa kisi se nahin darte the, aur is safar mein do rak'at namaz padhte."
"343","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai bayan farmate hain main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Madinah mein zuhr ki namaz chaar rak'at padhi aur Zul Hulaifah maqam par asr ki namaz do rak'at qasr padhi."
"344","[AI-translation] Ibn Munkadir se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se suna woh sabiqa hadees ki misl bayan farmate the."
"345","[AI-translation] Ek doosri sanad se Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se isi tarah marvi hai."
"346","[AI-translation] Nafi' se riwayat hai ke woh Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) ke sath ek bureed safar karte to woh is safar mein namaz qasr nahin karte the."
"347","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se marvi hai ke in se poocha gaya: 'Kya Arfah tak namaz qasr ki jaegi?' Farmaya: 'Nahin balke Usfan, Juddah aur Taif tak safar ki soorat mein qasr ho gi.'"
"348","[AI-translation] Salim bin Abdullah se riwayat hai ke Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne Zatin Nasab ki taraf safar kiya, aur is raste mein namaz qasr ki. Imam Malik farmate hain: Madinah aur Zatin Nasab ke darmiyan chaar bureed ka fasla hai."
"349","[AI-translation] Salim bin Abdullah se riwayat hai ke Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) Reem Madinah ke qareeb jagah ka naam ki taraf sawar ho kar gae, aur is raste mein namaz qasr padhi. Imam Malik farmate hain: Yeh bhi Madinah se chaar bureed par waqe hai."
"350","[AI-translation] Ata bin Abi Rabah se riwayat hai woh bayan farmate hain main ne Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se poocha: 'Kya main Arfah tak qasr karun?' Unhon ne farmaya: 'Nahin balke Juddah, Usfan aur Taif tak, aur agar tu khandan ke sath aae ya paidal to mukammal padh.' Ata kahte hain: Aur yahi qaul Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) ka hai aur ham is par amal karen ge."
"351","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se marvi hai unhon ne farmaya: Usfan, Taif aur Juddah tak namaz qasr ki jaegi. Aur yeh sari jagahen Makkah se chaar bureed par hain aur isi tarah utni masafat par maujood jagahon mein bhi qasr hai."
"352","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke woh Zatin Nasab ki taraf nikle aur unhon ne namaz qasr padhi. Imam Malik farmate hain aur yeh chaar bureed par hai."
"353","[AI-translation] Ya'la bin Umayyah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai bayan farmate hain main ne Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) se poocha: 'Allah Ta'ala ne khauf ki haalat mein to qasr ka zikr kiya hai, lekin khauf ke ilawa qasr kahan hai?' Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: 'Mujhe bhi is cheez ne hairat mein dala jis se Aap hairan hain. To main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se sawal kiya, Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Yeh sadqa hai jo Allah ne tum par kiya hai tum is ke sadqe ko qabool karo.'"
"354","[AI-translation] Ya'la bin Umayyah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai bayan farmate hain main ne Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) se poocha: 'Beshak Allah Ta'ala ne farmaya: Tum namazon ko qasr karo, agar tumhen dar ho ke kafir sataenge [Nisa: 101] ab to logon ko aman hai?' To Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: 'Mujhe bhi is baat par ta'ajjub hua tha jis par Aap ko hua hai to main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poocha, Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Yeh sadqa hai, sadqa kiya hai lehaza tum is ke sadqe ko qabool karo.'"
"355","[AI-translation] Ibn Musayyab se riwayat hai bayan farmate hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Tum mein se woh log behtareen hain jo jab safar karen to namaz qasr karen aur roza iftar karen' ya farmaya: 'Jo roza na rakhen.'"
"356","[AI-translation] Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai woh bayan farmati hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne safar mein namaz qasr bhi ki aur mukammal bhi padhi."
"357","[AI-translation] Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se marvi hai, unhon ne farmaya: Pahle namaz do do rak'aten farz ki gai, haalat iqamat ki namazon mein zyadati kar di gai aur safar ki namaz apni haalat par baqi rakhi gai. Zuhri farmate hain main ne poocha to phir khud Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) safar mein kyun poori padhtin thin? Urwah ne jawab diya ke jo taweel Usman (Raziyallahu anhu) ne ki thi wahi unhon ne bhi kar li."
"358","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se marvi hai ke woh jab Mina mein imam ke peeche padhte to chaar farz padhte aur jab khud padhte to do rak'aten padhte the."
"359","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke woh safar mein farzi namaz ke sath pahle ya baad mein kuch nahin padhte the, magar yeh ke tahajjud ki namaz."
"360","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai woh bayan farmate hain: 'Kya main tumhen Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki safar ki namaz ke mutalliq na bataun? Aap ghar mein hote aur suraj dhal jata to zuhr aur asr ko zawal ke waqt jama kar lete, aur agar suraj ke zawal se qabl safar karte to zuhr ko lait karte yahan tak ke zuhr aur asr ko asr ke waqt mein jama kar lete.' Kuraib farmate hain Aap ne mere khayal ke mutabiq maghrib aur isha ke mutalliq bhi isi tarah kaha."
"361","[AI-translation] Mu'az bin Jabal (Raziyallahu anhu) bayan farmate hain ke woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Tabuk wale saal safar mein nikle. Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) zuhr, asr aur maghrib, isha ko jama kar lete. Farmaya: 'Ek din namaz lait ki phir nikle aur zuhr, asr padhi. Phir aae aur baad mein phir safar ko nikle to maghrib aur isha ikatthi padhi.'"
"362","[AI-translation] Isma'il bin Abdur Rahman bin Abi Zi'b Asadi se riwayat hai woh bayan karte hain ke ham Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) ke sath Jama' maqam ki taraf gae, suraj ghurub ho gaya, ham unhen yeh kahne se dar rahe the ke sawariyon se utren taake namaz padh len, jab aasman ki safedi ghaib ho gai aur raat ki ibtidai siyahi aa gai, to woh sawari se utre aur teen rak'at namaz padhi phir salam phaira, phir do rak'aten padhin aur salam phaira, phir hamen mukhatab kar ke farmaya: 'Main ne dekha Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne is tarah kiya.'"
"363","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai woh bayan farmate hain ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko jab safar ke liye jaldi chalna hota to Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) maghrib aur isha jama kar lete."
"364","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) farmate hain ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko jab safar ke liye jaldi jana hota to Aap isha aur maghrib jama kar lete."
"365","[AI-translation] Mu'az bin Jabal (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) zuhr, asr aur maghrib, isha ko apne Tabuk ke safar mein jama karte the."
"366","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai bayan farmate hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne zuhr, asr ki aur maghrib, isha ki namazen baghair khauf aur safar ke jama kar ke padhin. Imam Malik farmate hain: Mere khayal mein yeh barish ke andar tha."
"367","[AI-translation] Abdur Rahman bin Humaid se riwayat hai woh bayan farmate hain ke Umar bin Abdul Aziz ne apne ham nasheenon se poocha: 'Tum ne muhajir ke Makkah mein qayam ke bare mein kya suna hai?' Sa'ib bin Yazeed (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha mujhe Ala' bin Hadrami (Raziyallahu anhu) ne bayan kiya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Hajj ke ahkamat ada karne ke baad muhajir teen din qayam kare ga.'"
"368","[AI-translation] Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Batn Nakhl maqam par Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne logon ko khauf mein zuhr ki namaz padhai. Ek giroh ko do rak'aten padhain phir salam phaira, phir doosra giroh aaya unhen bhi do rak'aten padhain phir salam phaira."
"369","[AI-translation] Salih bin Khawwat ne aise shakhs se riwayat kiya, jis ne Zatur Riqa' ke din Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath namaz khauf padhi thi. Us shakhs ne bayan kiya ke ek giroh ne Aap ke sath namaz ke liye saf bandi ki aur ek giroh dushman ke muqabla ke liye is ke rubaru saf basta ho gaya. Aap ne in logon ko jo Aap ke sath saf bandh kar khade the ek rak'at padhai aur Aap seedhe khade rahe, unhon ne apne taur par baqi namaz mukammal ki aur chale gae, ja kar dushman ke samne saf bandh li. Phir doosra giroh aaya, Aap ne use baqi apni ek rak'at padhai aur baithe rahe, unhon ne is dauran apni baqi namaz poori kar li. Phir Aap ne in ke sath salam phaira."
"370","[AI-translation] Ek doosri sanad se Khawwat bin Jubair Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai isi sabiqa hadees ke hum-ma'na, jo pahli ke khilaf nahin."
"371","[AI-translation] Nafi' se riwayat hai ke Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se jab namaz khauf ka sawal hota to Aap farmate: Imam ke sath ek giroh pahle namaz padhe ga phir aage hadees namaz khauf ki bayan ki aur Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne is hadees mein kaha: 'Agar khatra bahut zyada ho to chalte hue aur sawari par namaz padho, qibla rukh ho kar, aur ghair qibla rukh ho kar namaz padho.' Imam Malik farmate hain Nafi' ne kaha ke Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne is ko Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bayan kiya."
"372","[AI-translation] Ek doosri sanad se Salim apne baap Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se isi sabiqa hadees ki misl bayan farmate hain."
"373","[AI-translation] Nafi' se marvi hai unhon ne Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se namaz khauf ke silsila mein kuch mukhtalif bayan kiya hai aur Malik farmate hain ke main ise nahin bayan karta magar Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se aur Ibn Abi Zi'b is ko Zuhri se riwayat hai, Zuhri Salim se aur Salim Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat karte hain, Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bayan karte hain, jis mein woh shak nahin karte."
"374","[AI-translation] Nafi' se riwayat hai woh Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se aur kahte hain mere khayal mein Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bayan kiya, namaz khauf ka zikr kiya to farmaya: 'Agar khatra zyada ho to paidal chalte hue aur sawariyon par, qibla rukh aur ghair qibla rukh ho kar namaz padho.'"
"375","[AI-translation] Salim apne baap Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se sabiqa hadees ke hum-ma'na bayan karte hain. Aur unhen is mein shak nahin hai ke yeh in ke baap se marvi hai aur yeh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se marfu' hai."
"376","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai woh bayan farmate hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) safar mein apni oontni par namaz padhte, is ka munh jis taraf bhi ho jata."
"377","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai unhon ne bayan farmaya ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko gadhe par namaz padhte hue dekha, jabke Aap ka chehra Khaibar ki taraf tha. Imam Shafi'i ne farmaya: Yani nafl namaz."
"378","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhu) bayan farmate hain ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko oontni par har samt mein nawafil padhte hue dekha hai."
"379","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Bani Anmar ke ghazwa mein apni oontni par mashriq ki samt ho kar namaz padh rahe the."
"380","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Bani Anmar ke ghazwa mein apni oontni par mashriq ki taraf munh kiye hue namaz padh rahe the."
"381","[AI-translation] Abu Zubair Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhu) se sabiqa hadees ki misl marfu' bayan karte hain albatta farmaya: 'Mujhe nahin maloom ke unhon ne Bani Anmar ka naam liya ya farmaya safar mein namaz padhi.'"
"382","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne ek raat Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki zauja mutahhara aur apni khala Maimunah (Raziyallahu anha) ke ghar guzari. Farmaya: Main takiya ke arz mein lait gaya, aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aur Aap ki ahliya is ke tool mein lait gae, Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) so gae hatta ke jab aadhi raat ka waqt hua ya is se thodi der pahle ya thodi der baad Aap bedar hue aur apne hathon se chehre se neend ko door karne lage, phir Aap ne Surah Aal Imran ki aakhri dus aayaten padhin, phir Aap ek khunti par latki hui mashk ki taraf gae aur is se khoob achchi tarah wuzu kiya. Phir khade ho kar namaz padhne lage. Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) kahte hain main bhi uth khada hua aur isi tarah kiya jis tarah Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne kiya tha. Phir main Aap ke baen pahlu mein khada ho gaya, Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apna dahna hath mere sar par rakha, aur mera dayan kaan pakad kar use marodne lage, Aap ne do rak'aten padhin, is ke baad phir do rak'aten padhin, is ke baad phir do rak'aten padhin, is ke baad phir do rak'aten padhin, is ke baad phir do rak'aten padhin, phir Aap ne witr padha aur lait gae. Hatta ke muazzin aaya to Aap ne uth kar do halki si rak'aten padhin phir bahar tashreef lae aur subah ki namaz padhai."
"383","[AI-translation] Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) raat ko gyarah rak'at namaz padhte, in mein ek rak'at witr hota tha."
"384","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Raat ki namaz do do rak'at hai phir jab koi subah ho jane se dare to ek rak'at padh le, woh is ki sari namaz ko taq bana de gi.'"
"385","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se raat ki namaz se mutalliq poocha to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Raat ki namaz do do rak'at hai, phir jab koi tum mein se subah sadiq ho jane se dare to ek rak'at padh le, woh is ki sari namaz ko taq bana de gi.'"
"386","[AI-translation] Ek doosri sanad se Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se isi tarah marvi hai."
"387","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai bayan farmate hain main ne suna Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) farma rahe the: 'Raat ki namaz do do rak'at hai. Phir jab koi subah sadiq ho jane se dare to ek rak'at witr padh le.'"
"388","[AI-translation] Ek doosri sanad se Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) ke wasta se woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se isi tarah marvi hai."
"389","[AI-translation] Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai bayan farmati hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne raat ke har hissa mein witr padhe aur aakhri umr mein Aap ke witr umooman sahar ke waqt khatm hote the."
"390","[AI-translation] Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) paanch rak'at witr padhte, in rak'at mein sirf aakhri rak'at mein tashahhud baithe aur phir salam phair dete."
"391","[AI-translation] Ibn Shihab se riwayat hai ke Sa'd bin Abi Waqqas (Raziyallahu anhu) ek rak'at witr padha karte the."
"392","[AI-translation] Nafi' se riwayat hai bayan farmati hain main Makkah mein Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) ke sath tha aur aasman par badal chhae hue the, Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) subah sadiq ke tulu hone se dare to unhon ne ek rak'at witr padha, phir badal chhat gae, aur unhon ne raat dekhi to ek aur rak'at se use juft bana liya."
"393","[AI-translation] Nafi' se riwayat hai ke Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) jab teen rak'at witr padhte to do padh kar salam phairte phir zaroorat se guftagu bhi farmate."
"394","[AI-translation] Kuraib Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) ke aazad karda ghulam bayan karte hain ke unhon ne Mu'awiyah (Raziyallahu anhu) ko dekha unhon ne isha ki namaz padhi, phir ek rak'at witr ke ilawa kuch na padha. Kuraib ne Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se yeh baat bayan ki to unhon ne farmaya: 'Unhon ne durust kaha, aey bete! Mu'awiyah (Raziyallahu anhu) se badh kar ham mein se koi is bare mein zyada nahin janta. Yeh witr ek ya paanch ya saat se bhi zyada hain. Jitne chahe koi padhe.'"
"395","[AI-translation] Sa'ib bin Yazeed se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi ne Abdur Rahman Taimi se Talha (Raziyallahu anhu) ki namaz se mutalliq poocha, to Abdur Rahman Taimi ne kaha agar tu chahe to main tujhe Usman (Raziyallahu anhu) ki namaz se mutalliq bataun. Farmaya main ne kaha ek jagah raat ka waqt ho gaya achanak main utha to ek aadmi jo sar dhanpe hue tha mujh se takraya, main ne dekha to woh Usman (Raziyallahu anhu) the. Main in se peeche ho gaya unhon ne namaz padhi, to woh Quran ke sajde karte yahan tak ke main ne kaha: Fajr tulu ho rahi hai to unhon ne ek rak'at witr ke ilawa kuch na padha."
"396","[AI-translation] Hittan bin Abdullah se riwayat hai bayan farmate hain ke Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: 'Witr teen qism ke hain tum mein se jo raat ke pahle hissa mein padhna chahe woh pahle mein padh le, phir agar bedar ho to chahe to is ko ek rak'at se juft bana kar do do rak'aten padhe yahan tak ke subah sadiq ho jae aur agar chahe to raat ke aakhri hissa mein witr padhe.'"
"397","[AI-translation] Abdur Rahman bin Abd Qari se riwayat hai kehte hain main ne Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) se suna woh bayan karte hain, ke main ne ek daf'a Hisham bin Hakim bin Hizam (Raziyallahu anhu) ko Surah Furqan is qiraat par padhte suna jo is ke khilaf thi jo main padhta tha. Halanke mujhe khud Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne woh qiraat sikhai thi. Qareeb tha ke main in par ghussa nikalun, lekin phir main ne in ko mohlat di, hatta ke woh namaz se farigh hue to main ne in ke gale mein unhi ki chadar daal kar in ko ghaseet-ta hua Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki khidmat mein le aaya. Main ne kaha ke main ne unhen is qiraat ke khilaf padhte suna hai jo Aap ne mujhe padhai hai. Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Hisham (Raziyallahu anhu) se farmaya: 'Padho!' To unhon ne is qiraat mein padha jis mein main ne unhen padhte suna tha. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Ke isi tarah nazil hui'. Phir mujhe kaha: 'Tum padho!' To main ne bhi padha, phir Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Is tarah bhi Quran nazil kiya gaya hai. Beshak Quran saat lughaat mein nazil kiya gaya hai, jo lughaat mayassar ho isi mein padho.'"
"398","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai bayan farmate hain main ne Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ko hamesha yun padhte hue suna hai: 'To Allah ke zikr ki taraf chalo.'"
